<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id" />
  <para style="h">MAAKO</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maako</para>
  <para style="toc1">Makani Mabotu aa Jesu Kilisitu Aakalembwa o MAAKO</para>
  <para style="mt2">Makani Mabotu aa Jesu Kilisitu Aakalembwa o</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAAKO</para>
  <para style="imt">Bupanduluzi</para>
  <para style="ip">Bbuku lya Maako litalika okwaamba “Makani mabotu aamba zya Jesu Kilisitu, Mwanaa Leza.”</para>
  <para style="ip">Jesu utondezegwa kuteeti muntu ulipede kukucita zintu zya Leza ape ujesi bulelo. Bulelo bwakwe bulalibonya muziisyo zyakwe zyenguzu okutanda madimona, ape omukujatila bantu zibi. Jesu ulyaamba kuteeti Mwanoo Muntu, wakeza kunununa bantu kuzibi zyabo okubapa buumi butamani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iino Maako waamba caano ca Jesu munzila iluleme, igaminina alizyaakacita Jesu, kutali feela aziisyo zyakwe. Iino waamba zya Joni Mubbabbatizi okubbabbatizigwa okusunkwa kwa Jesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kuzwaawo Maako waamba musebezi wa Jesu wokuponya okwiisya. Nikwakainda nako basikwiiya bakwe bakatalika kumumvwisisisya, kono basinkondonyina bakatalika kumulwana. Zipati zyamamanino aabbuku eeli zyaamba zye nsondo yamamanino mubuumi bwa Jesu, olufu okubuka kwakwe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kuli mamanino obile mumakani mabotu a Maako ayeyelwa kuteeti taakalembedwe o Maako.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mundandaanda wezili Mwateni</para>
  <para style="io1">Matalikilo amakani mabotu a Maako<char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-13">1:1-13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Misebezi ya Jesu mu Galileya<char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 1:14-9:50">1:14—9:50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kuzwa ku Galileya kuza ku Jelusalemu<char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 10:1-52">10:1-52</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nsondo yamamanino aafwiifwi o Jelusalemu<char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 11:1-15:47">11:1—15:47</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kubuka kwa Jesu<char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">16:1-8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kuboneka kwa Mwami Jesu okutolwa kujulu<char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 16:9-20">16:9-20</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Bukamboosi bwa Joni Mubbabbatizi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateyo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Joni 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Aaya nga Makani Mabotu aa Jesu Kilisitu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Kilisitu” caamba kuteeti “Munanike” na “Unanikidwe” muci Giliki, ape ndibbala lomwi o “Mesiya” kuteeti feela lyo lyakazwida ku Chaalamaiki na Chihibulu.</char></note> Mwanaa Leza.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Malaki 3:1</ref>.</char>
    </note> Akatalika mboonyina mbuli mbwakalemba musinsimi Izaya kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Leza wakaambila Mwanaa Mesiya kuteeti, ndiyootuma mutumwa wangu kunembo lyako kuyoobamba nzila motizooinde.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Izaya 40:3</ref>.</char>
    </note> Kuli woongolola munkanda kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Amubambile limwi mugwagwa wo Mwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">amululamike nzila yakwe!’”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Aaya majwi akazuzikizigwa Joni naakalibonya musaka, kakambooka okubbabbatizya bantu okubaambila kuteetii, “Amusanduke, mweempe okubbabbatizigwa mpoonyina Leza ulamujatila zibi zyenu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Bantu banji bazwa mucooko ca Judiya omutaindi lya Jelusalemu bakainka kuyoomvwa Joni. Bakalyaambilila zibi zyabo mpoonyina wakababbabbatizya mumulonga wa Jolodani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Bami 1:8</ref>.</char>
    </note>Joni walikuzwaata zizwato zyakapangwa oboya bwe nkamela, okulyaanga lukanda lwecitobo mucikungu cakwe. Walikulya mpaso obuci. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Wakaambilizya kubantu kuteeti, “Kuluuza musule lyangu uleenguzu loko kwiinda ndime cokuteeti tandeeleli kukotama okumwaangununa zinyantela zyakwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Ndimubbabbatizya amaanzi, kono we uzomubbabbatizya o Muuya Uusalala.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubbabbatizigwa Okusunkwa kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mateyo 3:13—4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Muciindi eeco, Jesu wakasika kuzwa kutaindi lya Nazaleta lili mucooko ca Galileya, mpoonyina wakabbabbatizigwa o Joni mumulonga wa Jolodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Mbwakazwida feela mumaanzi Jesu, wakabona julu kalijuka o Muuya kuumuselukila mbuli nziba. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Matalikilo 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Intembauzyo 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Izaya 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mateyo 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:7">Maako 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luka 3:22</ref>.</char></note>Mpoonyina kwakamvwika jwi kuzwa kujulu kaliteeti, “Uli Mwanaangu ngondiyandisisya, mulindiwe mondibotelwa loko.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Mpoonyinaawo wakasolwedwa o Muuya Uusalala kwiinka musaka. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Wakakala mazuba aali makumi one, kaalimukusunkwa o Satani. Mwalaabanyama mwateni, mpoonyina bangelo bakeza kuzoomugwasya.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waita Basikuzuba Nswi Bone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mateyo 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Kuzwa Joni Mubbabbatizi naakabikwa muntolongo, Jesu wakainka ku Galileya okuyookambooka Makani Mabotu aa Leza. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mateyo 3:2</ref>.</char></note>Wakateeti, “Amweempe, musyome Makani Mabotu, kaambo nako yeelede yasika o Bwami bwa Leza bwaswena afwiifwi.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Bumwi buzuba Jesu naalikuyoobweenda ankomwe yo lwizi lwa Galileya, wakabona bazubi bobile, Saimoni omuzyalwanyina Andulu, kabazuba nswi otunyandi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Jesu wakateeti kulibo, “Amundicilile! Ndimwiisye kuba bazubi babantu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Mpoonyinaawo bakasiya tunyandi twabo okumucilila.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Wakeenda feela aniini mpoonyina wakabona Jemusi omuzyalwanyina Joni, bana ba Zebbediya, kabasuma-suma tunyandi twabo mumugolo. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Mpoonya-mpoonya wakabaita, mpoonyina bakasiya baisi ababelesi mumugolo okwiinka anguwe.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaalumi Waloo Muuya Mubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe bakainka kutaindi lya Kapenaumu. Mpoonyina Nsabata yakacilila wakainka kucikombelo okutalika kwiisya. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Mateyo 7:28-29</ref>.</char></note>Bantu bakamvwa mbwali kwiisya bakakomokwa loko kaambo taalikwiisya mbuli bamayi bo Mulawo, we walikwiisya enguzu zya Leza.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Mpoonyinaawo mucikombelo kwali mwaalumi waloomuuya mubi, wakatalika koongolola kuteeti, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Ino uyandanzi kulindiswe, Jesu woku Nazaleta? Wazotusinya na? Ndilikuzi, ndiwe uusalala wa Leza.”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Jesu wakalailila muuya mubi kuteeti, “Umuna! Zwa mumwaalumi ooyu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Mpoonyina muuya mubi wakamusuntusya kaukwiila loko, okuzwa mulinguwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Bantu boonse bakakomokwa mane bakatalika kubuzyanya kuteeti, “Ino eezi zeziitwa buti? Na ooku kokwiisya kupya kwenguzu? Ooyu mwaalumi ulalailila emyuuya mibi kuteeti izwe, mpoonyina ilamumvwida.”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Mpoonyina mpuwo ya Jesu yakasabalangana cokufwambaana mucooko coonse ca Galileya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waponya Bantu Banji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateyo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Kuzwaawo Jesu o Jemusi o Joni abasikwiiya bamwi, nibakazwa ku cikombelo bakainka kungʼanda ya Andulu o Saimoni. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Banyinazyala Saimoni balilede kaambo kokuciswa kupya mubili. Jesu ucisika feela bakamwaambila. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakainka okuyoobajata kujanza okubagwasya kunyamuka. Bakapona, mpoonyina bakayumbula Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe cokulya.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Nilyakabbila zuba, bantu boonse balikuciswa abalaamadimona bakeetwa kuli Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Bantu boonse bomutaindi bakabungana amulyango we ngʼanda. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Jesu wakaponya bantu banji balikuciswa malwazi asiyene-siyene, okutanda madimona manji. Taakwe naakaazumizya kwaamboola kaambo alimwizi.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bukamboosi bwa Jesu mu Galileya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Kubucedo, Jesu wakabuka okuzwa angʼanda okwiinka kucibaka cuumwine kwaakakukomba. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Mpoonyina Saimoni ambaakalaabo bakainka kuyoomulangoola. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Nibakamujana bakamwaambila kuteeti, “Bantu boonse bafwa kukulangoola.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakateeti, “Tweelede kwiinka kumiinzi ilaafwiifwi, kuteegwa ndikabakambookele abo, kaambo eeci cindakazida kucita.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mateyo 4:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:35">9:35</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mpoonyina wakeenda Galileya yoonse kayoobukambooka muzikombelo zyabo okutanda madimona.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waponya Mwaalumi Sicinsenda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateyo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Umwi mwaalumi walikuciswa cinsenda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bulwazi bwaambidwe awa bwaamba malwazi asiyene-siyene atabukila acikanda comubili womuntu ape mabi loko. Muntu wajesi bumwi bwamalwazi aaya wali muntu usofweede mumulawo wama Juda. Kweelana omulawo ooyu, mulwazi talikuzumizigwa abantu bamwi naanga kukomba mu Ngʼanda ya Leza. Kutina bapona kokuteeti basalala kweelana omulawo wama Juda, mpoonyina balikuzumizigwa kunjila mu Ngʼanda ya Leza okutola lubazu muzyokucita zyoonse zicitwa abantu mumiinzi.</char></note> wakainka kuli Jesu okuyoomufugamina. Mpoonyina wakamukumbila kuteeti amugwasye. Wakateeti, “Na ulayanda inga wandiponya.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Jesu wakamumvwida mangʼeke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wakamufwida mangʼeke: Mumalembo amwi a Chigiliki aamba kuteeti “Wakanyema” </char></note> loko, wakatandabika janza lyakwe okumuguma. Mpoonyina wakateeti, “Ndilayanda. Kopona!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Mpoonyinaawo cinsenda cakamana, ooyu mwaalumi wakapona. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43-44" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakamwaambilisisya loko kuteeti, “Mvwa! Utaambili muntu naanga omwi zyacitika. Kono koya kumupaizi, ukalitondezye, ukape cituuzyo mbuli mbwaakalailila Mozesi kuteegwa bantu bazibe kuteeti wapona.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:43-44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Levitiko 14:1-32</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyinaawo wakamuleka kuteeti ainke.<verse eid="MRK 1:43-44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Kono we nakainka wakaamboola loko alizyokupona kwakwe. Wakaambila bantu banji cokuteeti Jesu taakacili kukonzya okunjila mutaindi caantangalala. Wakali kukala kucibaka cuumwine, kono bantu bazwa mumasena aasiyene-siyene bakeza kulinguwe.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Waponya Mwaalumi Wakayuminide Mubili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateyo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Nikwakainda mazuba maniini, Jesu wakapiluka ku Kapenaumu. Makani okuteeti kwali angʼanda akasakana. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Mpoonyina bantu banji bakabungana cokuteetii mukati tikwalikwe cibaka aamulyango oonse. Jesu naalikubakambookela Makani Mabotu, <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />kwakeza bantu kulinguwe bakeeta mwaalumi wayuminide mubili, kanyamwidwe abaalumi bone. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Bakabula okumwiinzya kumutola kuli Jesu kaambo kokuvula kwabantu. Mpoonyina bakatulula atala eciluli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maanda manji alijesi manela anze kumbali obulambo kwiinka aciluli, eeci cakapa kuteeti batante aciluli ce ngʼanda Jesu mwalikwiisya kakutaakwe penzi. Bakavumboola aciluli okupanga bbango okwiinzizya fateni mulwazi. Ciluli cakapangidwe eminseme okumatwa edaka. Calitandabede cokuteeti aaba bantu bakakonzya kweenda aciluli mane kusika kululamaawo Jesu mpaakabede mungʼanda kaiisya. </char></note> kululama paali kubede Jesu okumwiinzya fateni kalede abulo bwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Jesu naakabona lusyomo lwabo wakaambila mulwazi kuteeti, “Mwanaangu, zibi zyako zyajatilwa.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Bamwi bamayi bo Mulawo bakakedeko bakatalika kulyamboozya mumyoyo yabo kuteeti, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Ino niinzi naamboola namu ooyu? Ooku kusampula Leza! Ngwani uunga wajatila zibi kunzaa Leza alike.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Mpoonyinaawo Jesu wakaziba zyobakali kuyeeya, mpoonyina wakababuzya kuteeti, “Ino niinzi nemuyeeya zili namu?” <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Wakababuzya kuteeti, “Ceecili cuuba, kwaambila uyumininide mubili kuteegwa ‘Zibi zyako zyajatilwa’ na kumwaambila kuteeti ‘Nyamuka, bweza bulo bwako weende’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Iino ndiyanda kumutondezya kuteeti Mwanoo Muntu uleenguzu aano ansi zyokujatila zibi.” Mpoonyina Jesu wakaambila mulwazi kuteeti, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Ndikwaambila kuteeti, nyamuka, bweza bulo bwako uye kungʼanda yako!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Cokufwambaana wakanyamuka, okubweza bulo bwakwe, okuzwawo kabalangilide boonse. Bantu bakakomokwa loko, okutalika kulumbaizya Leza kabateeti, “Tatunabwene cilinamu!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waita Levi Simutelo Okulya Abasizibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateyo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Kuzwaawo Jesu wakapiluka ankomwe yo Lwizi lwa Galileya. Imbunga yoonse yakeza kulinguwe mpoonyina wakatalika kubaiisya. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Naali kuyoobweenda wakabona simutelo Levi mwanaa Alifasi kakede paali kubelekela. Jesu wakamwaambila kuteeti, “Ndicilila!” Mpoonyinaawo wakanyamuka okumucilila.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Kuzwaawo Jesu naalikulya mungʼanda ya Levi. Basimutelo banji abasizibi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Basizibi” caamba bantu baleecilengwa cokutyola Mulawo wa Leza. Bafalisi bakaliyungizizye imwi milawo minji ku Mulawo wa Leza. Balikwiita boonse batalikucilila eeyi milawo kuteeti, “Basizibi”. Abasimitelo abo balikubaligwa muli basizibi.</char></note> bamwi bakasika okulyoo Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe, kaambo balibanji bakamucilila. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Bamwi bamayi bo Mulawo a Bafalisi, nibakabona kuteetii wali kulya abasizibi abasimutelo, bakabuzya basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti, “Ino niinzi nalya abantu bali namu?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Jesu naakamvwa namu wakabaambila kuteeti, “Bantu baumbulu tabayandiki musilisi aati baciswa. Sikazidilide kwiita bantu baluleme kono ndakazida kwiita basizibi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubuzyo Wokuliimya Kulya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateyo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Basikwiiya ba Joni Mubbabbatizi a Bafalisi bali kuliimya kulya. Mpoonyina bakeza kuli Jesu okubuzya kuteeti, “Ino kaamboonzi basikwiiya bako nebataliimyi kulya mbuli ndiswe a Bafalisi?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Jesu wakabataba kuteeti, “Ino inga beenzu basikukwata baliimya kulya acinolaabo na? Nee! Kutali nacilaabo. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Kono nako iyoosika, sikukwata nayoobwezegwa kuzwa kulibo. Pepawaawo nebayooliimya kulya.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Taakwe unga wabelesya cigamba cecizwato cipya okucilukila acizwato ceciindi, kaambo cigamba cipya cilafwiinyana okumonkola cizwato ceciindi, mpoonyina bbanga lilakomenena limwi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bbanga Ndibbala limbi lyaamba cintu comwi ecipulo panga muntu waizyawo cintu. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Ape taakwe uutila waini impya munkomo zyamatobo zyakabeleka kale, kaambo zilabbotoka, okusinyekelaamwi o waini. Kono waini impya yeelede kutilwa munkomo zyamatobo zipya.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubuzyo we Nsabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mateyo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Detilonomo 23:25</ref>.</char>
    </note> Bumwi buzuba bwe Nsabata, Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe bakatimbwida mumyuunda yamaila. Basikwiiya bakwe bakatalika kupulula mitwe yamaila. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Bamwi Bafalisi baliwo bakabuzya Jesu kuteeti, “Bona! Ino niinzi basikwiiya bako nebacita cuutazumizi Mulawo wesu mu Nsabata?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Milawo yama Juda yalikuzumizya muntu kubweza tuseke tunini twamaila kuzwa mumunda wo muntu umbi (Detilonomo 23:25). Bafalisi tibalikupa basikwiya mulandu wokubba. Balikubapa mulandu wokubeleka, wokukutula mu Nsabata. Mulawo wa Mozesi walikulailila kutabelaka mubuzuba bwe Nsabata. </char></note><verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Samuele 21:1-6</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mpoonyina Jesu wakababuzya kuteeti, “Ino taakwe nimwakabala caakacita Deveti, we abantu mbaalaabo nibakafwide nzala na?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Inkani Jesu njalimukwaamba ijanika muli 1 Samiyele 21:1-6. Eeyi nkani cikozyanisyo cibotu citondezya Mafalisi Jesu caalikuyanda kubaambila. Deveti nalikuyoobucija Mwami Saulu. We, abaalumi mbalaabo baleenzala. Bakeza ku Ngʼanda ya Leza, mpoonyina Deveti wakakumbila cilyo ku Mupaizi Mupati. Cilyo caliwo feela cali cinkwa cecituuzyo kuli Leza. Calikuligwa feela abapaizi. Kono Mupaizi Mupati wakacibweza eeci cinkwa okupa Deveti abaalumi mbalaabo mpoonyina bakalya. Naanga kuteeti Deveti wakacita catalikuzumizigwa, Leza taakwe naakapa Deveti abaalumi mbalaabo cisubulo. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Levitiko 24:9</ref>.</char></note> Wakanjila mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza okulya cinkwa calicipaizyo kuli Leza. Eezi zyakacitika Abbiyata naali Mupaizi mupati. Kweelana omu Mulawo, bapaizi abalike mbibakazumizidwe kulya cinkwa eeci, kono Deveti wakacilya okupako bantu bakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Mukumaninizya Jesu wakaamba kuteeti, “Nsabata yakalengelwa bantu, kono bantu tabakalengeledwe Nsabata. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Kaambo keeci Mwanoo Muntu ngo Mwami owe Nsabata.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Waponya Mwaalumi Uyuminide Janza mu Nsabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mateyo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Aimwi Nsabata, Jesu wakanjila mu cikombelo ape. Oomo mwali mwaalumi wayuminide janza. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Bakamulangisisya kuyanda kubona na ulamuponya mu Nsabata kuteegwa bamujanine mulandu. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakaambila mwaalumi ooyu kuteeti, “Koza kunembo.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Mpoonyina wakababuzya kuteeti, “Ino ceecili Mulawo wesu cuuzumizya kucita mu Nsabata? Kucita cibotu na cibi? Kufutula buumi na kujaya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Taakwe nibakamutaba naanga comwi. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Jesu naakabalanga wakanyema o kuusa kaambo kokuyuma kwemyoyo yabo. Mpoonyina wakaambila mwaalumi ooyu kuteeti, “Olola janza lyako.” Mpoonyina wakacita mboonyina namu, janza lyakapona. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Mpoonyina Bafalisi bakazwa mucikombelo okuyooswaanana abana Helodi kuyoopangana mbobanga bamujaya Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbunga Yabantu Yacilila Jesu Ankomwe yo Lwizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Kuzwaawo Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe bakainka ku lwizi lwa Galileya, mpoonyina mabungaabantu akabacilila. Bamwi bakazwa ku Galileya oku Judiya <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />oku Jelusalemu okucilalaanda ce Idumiya ecili kujwe lya Jolodani ecizingulikide mataindi omu Tayila o Sidoni. Bantu banji bakeza kuli Jesu kaambo bakamvwa zyaalikucita. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:1">Maako 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luka 5:1-3</ref>.</char></note>Ali mabunga-mabunga mane Jesu wakaambila basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti bamubambile mugolo kuteegwa bantu batamusyaanikizyi. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Kaambo kokuteeti wakaponya bantu banji, boonse balikucisidwe bakalisyanikizya kuteegwa bamugume kuteeti baponisigwe. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Ape boonse bakanjidwe myuuya mibi bamubona, yalikubawisya kunembo lyakwe okoongolola kuteeti, “Uli Mwanaa Leza.”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Jesu wakaambilisisya myuuya mibi kuteeti itamuzibisyi kubantu.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Wasala Baapositola Bali Kumi Abobile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateyo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakainka acilundu okwiita baalumi mbaalikuyanda kuteeti baze kulinguwe. Bakeza kulinguwe, <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />mpoonyina wakasala fateni bali kumi abobile, okubaita kuteeti mbaapositola. Wakabaambila kuteegwa “Ndamusala kuteeti katulilimwi, mpoonyina ndizoomutuma kuyookambooka, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />ape muzoba enguzu zyokutanda madimona.”<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Aaba bali kumi abobile mbaakasala kwali: Saimoni, Jesu ngwakauzika kuteegwa Pita, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Jemusi omuzyalwanyina Joni, bana ba Zebbediya, Jesu wakabauzika kuteegwa Bonajesi, kokuteeti “bantu bali mbuli muzumo”, <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andulu, Filipo, Bbatolomeyo, Mateyo, Tomasi, Jemusi mwanaa Alifasi, Tediyasi, Saimoni uteegwa Sikulwanina Lwaanguluko, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />o Judasi Isikaliyoti wakazoaba Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Uleenguzu Kwiinda Bbelizebbuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mateyo 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakainka kungʼanda kwaali kukala. Ape kwakabungana bantu banji cokuteeti mane Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe bakabula nako yokuteeti balye. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Bomukwasyi wakwe nibakamvwa namu, bakainka kuyoomujata kaambo balikwaamba kuteeti, “Wasondoka!”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mateyo 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bamwi bamayi bo Mulawo bakazwa ku Jelusalemu balikwaamba kuteeti, “Unjilidwe Bbelizabbuli, mwami wamadimona! Nguumupa nguzu zyokwaatanda.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakabaita okubaambila muzikozyanyo kateeti, “Ino Satani inga watanda buti Sataninyina? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Na cisi kacaanzeene mutubunga tulwaanisyanya mulicato cilasinyeka. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Ape kuteeti mukwasyi kawaanzeene mulicawo ulamwacooka. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Iino kuteeti bwami bwa Satani kabwaanzeene mutubunga tulwanisyanya, taakwe kobuya, kono bulamwacooka.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />“Taakwe unga wanjila mungʼanda yo mwaalumi singuzu okumubbida zibya zyakwe, aati kumwanga pili. Mpoonyina naloobubbide.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Nconzyo ndamwaambila kuteeti muntu inga wajatilwa kuzibi zyoonse zyanga wacita nebuba busampoozi boonse mbwangawaamba. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luka 12:10</ref>.</char></note>Kono kufumbwa usampoola Muuya Uusalala tayoojatilwi, kaambo ulamulandu wokucita cibi citamani.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Jesu wakaamba namu kaambo bamwi bantu balikwaamba kuteeti, “Unjilidwe muuya mubi.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banyina Abazyalwanyina Jesu Beni-beni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateyo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Mpoonyina banyina abazyalwanyina Jesu bakeza okwiima anze lye ngʼanda, okutuma muntu kuteetii amwiite. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Bantu banji balikede kabamuzingulukide Jesu, mpoonyina bakamwaambila kuteeti, “Bona! Banyoko abazyalwanyoko balaanze bayanda yebo.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Jesu wakataba kuteeti, “Ino bamama abazyalwama beni-beni mbaabali?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Mpoonyina wakalanga bantu bakamuzingulukide okwaamba kuteeti, “Aaba mbabamama abazyalwama! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Kufumbwa ucita zyayanda Leza muzyalwama, mucizaangu, mbamama.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Cikozyanyo Casikuhasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateyo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luka 5:1-3</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ape Jesu wakatalika kwiisya ankomwe yo Lwizi lwa Galileya. Bantu banji bakamubunganina, kaambo kokuvula kwabantu, Jesu wakanjila okukala mumugolo wali mumaanzi. Bantu bo baimvwi ankomwe yo lwizi. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Wakabaiisya zintu zisiyene-siyene mukubelesya zikozyanyo, mukwiisya kwakwe wakateeti:<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Amumvwe! Kwali umwi mulimi wakainka kuyoohasa mbuto. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Naakali kuhasa mbuto mumuunda, zimwi zyakawida mumbali enzila, mpoonyina bayuni bakasika okuzilya. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Zimwi mbuto zyakawida munyika yebbwe lipateme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndibbwe lipateme, liyalidwe, litandabede. Oobu bupanduluzi bwapegwa kaambo kokwiindana mboliitwa bbwe eeli muzilalaanda zyobu Toka-Leya. </char></note> yakajesi muse muce. Mpoonyina imbuto eezyo cokufwambaana zyakamena kaambo muse wakali muce. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Mpoonyina zuba nilyakabala, zyakapya okuyuma kaambo miyanda taakwe niyakainka loko ansi. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Mbuto zimwi zyakawida munyika yakamenede myuumvwa. Mpoonyina nizyakakomenena antoomwi, myuumvwa yakazifundilizya zisyango okuzisinkilizya, cokuteeti zyakakacilwa kuzyala micelo. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Mbuto zimwi zyakawida mumuse mubotu, zyakamena okukomena okuzyala micelo. Zimwi zyakavuzyanya makumi otatwe, zimwi makumi aali cisambomwi, zimwi mwaanda.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakamanizya okuteeti, “Amuswiilizye namulaamatwi okumvwisya!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muzeezo Wokwaambweeda Muzikozyanyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mateyo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Jesu naakalaalike, bamwi bakamumvwa abasikwiiya bakwe bali kumi abobile bakamwiinkila okuyoomukumbila kuteeti abapandululwide zikozyanyo. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Mpoonyina wakabataba kuteeti, “Mwapegwa zisisidwe zyo Bwami bwa Leza, kono bamwi bantu balapegwa zyoonseneni kwiinda muzikozyanyo. <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Izaya 6:9-10</ref>.</char></note>Kuteegwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Kabalanga okulangisya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">kono kabataboni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">kabaswiilizya okuswiilizisya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">kono kabatamvwi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">Kaambo nibali kumvwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">nibasandukila kuli Leza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">mpoonyina naabajatila’”.<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Wapandulula Cikozyanyo Casikuhasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateyo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakababuzya kuteeti, “Ino taakwe nimwacimvisisisya cikozyanyo eeci na? Ino muyooziziba buti zikozyanyo zimwi zyoonse?” <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Mulimi wakaminza majwi aa Leza. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Oobu mbobupanduluzi bwembuto yakawida mumbali enzila: Majwi aa Leza aminzwa, abantu baamvwa, cokufwambaana Satani uleza okubweza cakaminzwa mulibo. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Oobu mbobupanduluzi bwembuto yakawida anyika yebbwe lipateme yakajesi muse muce: Majwi aa Leza aminzwa, abantu bacaamvwa feela balaatambula cokufwambaana okubotelwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Kono taanjililili, ape taakalilili. Makatazyo amapenzi abasikila kaambo kamajwi balatyompwa okuleka kusyoma mpoonyinaawo. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Oobu mbobupanduluzi bwembuto yakawida mumuse wemiyanda yemyuumvwa: Aaba mbantu baamvwa majwi aa Leza, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />kono kulikalelwa zyobuumi okweeneenwa obuvubi okuyandisisya ezimbi, eezi zikasya majwi kuzyala micelo. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Oobu mbobupanduluzi bwembuto yakawida mumuse mubotu: Mbantu baamvwa majwi aa Leza, balaatambula mpoonyina balazyala micelo ivuzyanya, bamwi makumi otatwe, bamwi makumi ali cisambomwe, abamwi mwaanda.<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cikozyanyo ce Lampi Ecipimyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mateyo 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luka 11:33</ref>.</char>
    </note>Jesu wakazumanana kateeti, “Ino kuli muntu ubweza lampi okulivunika ecisuwo na kulibika munsi obulo? Ino talibikwi antangalala na?” <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mateyo 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luka 12:2</ref>.</char></note>Mbweenya namu, “Kufumbwa cisisidwe ciyoosisununwa, ape maseseke oonse ayeetwa antangalala.” <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Na kuli ulaamatwi ookumvwisya, amvwe!<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mateyo 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:38">Luka 6:38</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ape Wakabaambila kuteeti, “Amubikileko maano kuli zyemumvwa! Cipimyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aka kasimpi kalimukutondezya kuteeti kweelana okuzumanana kwa bantu mukuswiilisisya okuvwisisisya ziisyo zya Jesu, mbwatanobayungizizya kumvwisisisya. </char></note> comubelesezya bamwi awe Leza cayoomubelesezya, mane okwiindilizya. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mateyo 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:29">25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luka 19:26</ref>.</char></note>Aabo bajesi bayoopegwa zinji, kono uutajesi uyoonyangwa naanga kaniini kajesi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cikozyanyo Cokukomena kwe Mbuto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Jesu wakazwidaanembo kaamba kuteeti, “Bwami bwa Leza bulinamu: Umwi mwaalumi wakaminza mbuto mumuunda wakwe. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Walikulala masiku okubuka bwacha, muciindi eeco mbuto zyalikumena okuyoobukomena. Kono katezi mbuzyali kukomena. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Muse nguukomezya zisyango okuzyala micelo. Kusanguna kumena busonga, kuzwaawo cisiko cilakomena, mpoonyina kuzwa ngala, kumamanino kuba maila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muse ndibbala limbi lyaamba cintu comwi evu. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Joeli 3:13</ref>.</char></note>Mpoonyina abizwa maila, mulimi ulaatema kaambo nako yokukutula casika.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cikozyanyo ca Kaseke ke Masitadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mateyo 13:31-32</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Ape Jesu wakateeti, “Ino Bwami bwa Leza tulabweezyanisyeenzi? Ino inga twabupandulula ecikozyanyo cobuti? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Bwami Bokujulu buli mbuli cicitika kukaseke ke masitadi kabyalwa. Nekuba kuteeti aaka kekaseke kaniini loko munyika, kabyalwa mumuse <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />kwainda nako kalakomena okuba cisamu cipati kwiinda zyoonse. Cilaba entabi zipati cokuteeti tuyuni tulasika okupangila mwateni ziteente mumweemvule wateni.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Jesu wakakambookela bantu kwiindila muzikozyanyo zisiyene-siyene mbuli eezi, kweendelana ambobalikukonzezya kumvwisisisya. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Taakwe nakaamboola ambabo katabelesyi zikozyanyo, aati anoolifeela abasikwiiya bakwe, naalikubapandulwida zyoonseneni.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waimika Guwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateyo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Mboonyina obuya buzuba kujolezya, Jesu wakaambila basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti, “Atuzubukile kutala limwi lyo lwizi.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Mpoonyina bakasiya bbunga lyabantu. Basikwiiya bakwe bakatanta mumugolo mwalikukede Jesu, mpoonyina bakainka anguwe. Kwali emigolo imwi yalikuyobubacilila. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Pobatalikuyeeyela kwakaunga guwo pati, cokuteeti mayuwe akatalika kukupailila manzi mumugolo, mane watikazule. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Nako eeyo Jesu walilede musule lyomugolo, kabikide mutwe pokusegela. Basikwiiya bakwe bakamubusya okuteeti, “O mwiiyi, tobwene kuteegwa tuyanda kufwa na?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakanyamuka okulailila guwo amayuwe kuteeti, “Umuna!” Guwo lyakamana mpoonyina kwakaumuna zii. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Jesu wakabuzya basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti, “Ino niinzi nemuyowa namu? Eino tamuna kuba olusyomo na?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Kono bakayoowa loko okubuzyana kuteeti, “Ngwanooyu uunga mane guwo amayuwe zilamumvwida?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Wafutula Mwaalumi Unjilidwe Muuya Mubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateyo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Mpoonyina Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe bakasika mutala limwi lyo Lwizi lwa Galileya, lili mucilalaanda ca Gelasa. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Mbwaakazwida feela mumugolo Jesu, mwaalumi wakanjilidwe muuya mubi wakeza kuzwa mumayumbelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Calicizo cama Juda abantu bambi balikukala afwiifwi kubamba bafu muzyuumbwe zyampangala yezilundu. Naanga muzyumbwe zyokusya mumalundu naanga mumabbwe mapati.</char></note> okumuswaana. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Ooyu mwaalumi walikukala mumayumbelo. Taakwe wacilikukonzya kumubamba kaangidwe naanga amaceeni. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Ziindi zinji walikwaangwa kumaulu okumaanza amaceeni kono nako yoonse walikwaabbansula okutyoloola nsimbi zyakalikwaangwa kumaulu. Taakwe waleenguzu loko zyokumuzunda. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Masiku esikati walikweendeenda mumayumbelo omumalundu, kakwiila okulitendoola amabwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Muntu ooyu naakabona Jesu kacili aleele, wakazuza okuyoomuvundamina kunembo lyakwe, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />okukwiila loko kateeti, “Jesu, Mwanaa Leza Sijulu Wama Julu! Ino uyanda nzi kulindime? Muzina lya Leza ndakukumbila utandipi cisubulo!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Wakaamba namu kaambo Jesu walikumwaambila kuteeti, “O muuya mubi, kozwa mumwaalumi ooyu!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakamubuzya kuteeti, “Ino ndiweni zina?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Wakamutaba kuteeti, “Ndime ‘Dwi lyabasinkondo’ kaambo tulibanji loko!” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Mpoonyina wakazumanana kukumbila Jesu kuteeti myuuya mibi ataitandi kuzwa mucilalaanda eeco.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Iino afwiifwi kwali tanga pati lyengulube zyalikucela acilundu. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Mpoonyina madimona akakumbila Jesu kuteeti, “Tutandile mungulube kuteegwa tunjile mulizizyo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Kumane wakaazumizya. Mpoonyina akazwa mumwaalumi okuyoonjila mungulube. Lyakali tanga lyataakasike zyuulu zyobile, lyoonse lyakaselemuka kuzwa acilundu okuwida mulwizi okwiinkila.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Baalumi bali kweembela ngulube bakacija kabayoobusabalanganya nkaneeyi mutaindi omumiinzi. Mpoonyina bantu bakainka kuyoobona zyakacitika. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Nibakeza kuli Jesu, bakabona mwaalumi walinoonga wanjilidwe dwi lyamadimona kakede kazweete ape kasitikide. Mpoonyina boonse bakayoowa. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Aabo bakabona, bakaambila aabo bakeza zyakacitika kumwaalumi wakanjilidwe madimona, ezyakacitika kungulube.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Mpoonyina bakakombelezya Jesu kuteeti azwe mucilalaanda cabo.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Jesu naalikutanta mumugolo, mwaalumi wakanjilidwe madimona wakamukombelezya kuteeti ainke anguwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Kono Jesu wakakaka okumwaambila kuteeti, “Piluka kungʼanda ukaambile mbokalaabo zyoonse zyaakucitila Mwami ambwaakufwida mangʼeke.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Mpoonyina mwaalumi ooyu wakazwa okwiinka kucibaka camataindi aali Kumi, kayoobwaambilizya zyoonse caakamucitila Jesu. Boonse bakamvwa bakakomokwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanaa Jailosi o Mwanakazi Wakakuma Jansi lya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateyo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Jesu naakazubuka omugolo kupiluka kubbazu limwi lyo lwizi, bantu banji bakamubunganina ankomwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Mpoonyina kwakasika mwaalumi walikwiitwa kuteeti Jailosi, mweendelezi womu cikombelo. Naakabona Jesu wakamufugamina <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />okumukumbila cokuzumanana kuteeti, “Mwanaangu musimbi wafwa kuciswa. Aakaka koza umubike maanzaako kuteeti apone!”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakainka anguwe. Bantu balikuyoobucilila Jesu bali banji cokuteeti balikuyoobumusyanikizya.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Iino kwali mwanakazi walikuciswa bulwazi bwakalobola kwemyaka iili kumi eyobile. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Wakapenga loko kasilikwa abasilisi basiyene-siyene. Wakabelesya lubono lwakwe loonse, kono taakwe naakapona obulwazi nibwakazwida anembo kukomena. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Walimvwide kale zya Jesu mpoonyina wakanjila mubantu kusule lyakwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Okulyaambila kuteeti, “Naa ndakuma feela jansi lyakwe ndilapona.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Wakakuma kwateni, mpoonyinaawo gazi lyakaleka kuzwa okulimvwa kuteeti wapona. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Mpoonyinaawo Jesu wakamvwa kuteeti ngunzu zyazwa mulinguwe, wakacebooka mubantu okubuzya kuteeti, “Ngwani wandikuma kujansi?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Basikwiiya bakwe bakamutaba kuteeti, “Ulibwene bantu mbubakusyanikizya. Ino inga wabuzya buti kuteeti, ‘Ngwani wandikuma?’”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Kono Jesu wakaindilizya kulangoola wakamukuma. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Mwanakazi ooyu wakaziba cakamucitikila, mpoonyina wakeza kuli Jesu kayoobutuntuma obuyoofu. Wakamufukamina, amane wakamwaambila zyanconzyo zyoonseneni. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Jesu wakamwaambila kuteeti, “Omwanaangu, lusyomo lwako lwakuponya. Koya muluumuno, mapenzi aako amana.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Naacilikwaamboola namu Jesu, kwakeza bantu bakazwa kungʼanda ya Jailosi okwaambila Jailosi kuteeti, “Mwanaako wafwa. Ino ucimukatazizya nzi mwiiyi?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Jesu taakwe naakabikila kwateni maano zibakaamba, kono wakamwaambila kuteeti, “Utayoowi, syoma feela.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Mpoonyina taakwe ngwakazumizya kumucilila aati feela Pita o Jemusi omuzyalwanyina Joni. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Bakasika kungʼanda ya Jailosi okubona manyongwe abantu kabalila okoongolola loko. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Wakanjila mukati okubabuzya kuteeti, “Ino mwanyonganinanzi namu? Mulila nzi? Ooyu mwana tafwide, ulede feela.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Kono bo bakatalika kumufubaazika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">Mpoonyina wakabagwisizya anze okutola baisi abanyina aabo basikwiiya bakwe botatwe okunjila mwalikulede mwana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Wakamujata kujanza okwaamba kuteeti, <char style="tl">“Talita, komi!”</char> Kokuteeti, “Musimbi, ndikwaambila kuteeti nyamuka!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Wakanyamuka mpoonyinaawo okutalika kweendeenda. Waleemyaka ili kumi ayobile. Nicakacitika eeci aabo bakabona bakakomokwa loko. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakabalailisya kuteeti bataambili naanga muntu omwi. Kuzwaawo wakabaambila kuteeti, “Amumupe cokulya.”<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Wakakwa ku Nazaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateyo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Kuzwaawo Jesu antoomwi abasikwiiya bakwe bakazwa kucibaka eeco okuya kulibo. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Mu Nsabata wakatalika kwiisya mucikombelo. Mpoonyina bunji bwaabo bakamumvwa, bakakomokwa okubuzyana kuteeti, “Ino wakazijanayi eezi ziisyo? Ino oobu busongo wakabujanayi? Ino uzijanayi nguzu zyokupanga maleele?” <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />“Ino ooyu taalisikubeza, ooyu mwanaa Maliya, muzyalwanyina o Jemusi, Josefa, Judasi o Saimoni? Ede tukalaamwi abacizi bakwe?” Mpoonyina bakamukaka.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:44">Joni 4:44</ref>.</char>
    </note>Kuzwaawo Jesu wakabaambila kuteeti, “Musinsimi takwe mpuwo mucisi mwazwa okubamukwasyi wakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Talikukonzya kupangila kwateni maleele, kono wakabika maanzaakwe abantu baniini feela balikuciswa okubaponya. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Wakakomokwa loko kaambo kokubula lusyomo kwabantu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Jesu Watuma Basikwiiya Bali Kumi Abobile</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mateyo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Mpoonyina Jesu wakazinguluka mumiinzi kayoobwiisya bantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Jesu wakaita basikwiiya bali kumi abobile, wakabapa nguzu zyokugwisya myuuya mibi okubatuma bobile-bobile. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Okubalailila kuteeti, “Mutabwezi cilicoonse mumusinzo wenu aati feela nkoli. Mutanyamuni cilyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwakazwida Malembo aaya, ibbala lye cilyo lyaamba cinkwa.</char></note>, mpotomona, naanga mali munkomo. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Muzwaate zinyantela, kono mutabwezi zibaki kunzaazyomuzweete.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Ape wakaamba kuteeti, “Kufumbwa mu ngʼanda mobayoomutambula, mukakale moonyoomo kusikila mukazwe mucibaka eeco. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Misebezi 13:51</ref>.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luka 10:4-11</ref>.</char></note> Kono na mwasika mucibaka mumwatatambulwa, naanga bantu kobatayandi kumumvwida, mwanozwa kwateni mukunkumune suko ili kumaulu eenu kuteeti cikabe citondezyo cokubacenjezya.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Mpoonyina bakainka kabayoobukambooka kuteeti bantu beempwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Bakagwisya madimona manji, okunanika baciswa banji mafuta a oliva okubaponya.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lufu lwa Joni Mubbabbatizi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateyo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Kwakali Mwami walikuteegwa Helodi, wakali kulela cooko ca Galileya e ca Peliya. Mpuwo ya Jesu yakazomvwika loko cokuteeti Mwami Helodi wakiimvwa. Bamwi bantu balikwaamba Jesu kuteeti, “Ooyu ngu Joni Mubbabbatizi wabuka kuzwa kubafu! Cajesi nguzu zili namu zyokupanga maleele.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Kono bamwi balikwaamba kuteeti, “Ngu Elija.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elija wali Musinsimi (1 Bami 17:1-2 Bami 2:12), bukamboosi bwakwe bwali muciindi ca mwami Ahabu (mumyaka ya 874-852 Jesu katana kuzyalwa) wali mwami munyika yali kunyika ya Izilaili mu Efulemu. Elija wakazyalwa mu Tishibbi ape waambwa kuteeti wakazokala mu Giliyadi (1 Bami 17:1). Waleempuwo yokukazya zyokukomba Bbaali, (Bbaali wali leza wokubumba). Elija taakwe naakafwa kaambo wakatolwa kujulu.</char></note>” Bamwi balikwaamba kuteeti, “Uli mbuli musinsimi umwi wabeciindi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Helodi naakamvwa eezi wakateeti, “Ngu Joni Mubbabbatizi ngundakatimbuzya mutwe, kono wabuka kubafu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Helodi mwini wakatuma baalumi kuyoojata Joni okumubika muntolongo kaambo ka Helodiyasi mwanakazi wa Filipo muzyalwanyina ooyo Helodi ngwaalikukwete. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Helodi wakabika Joni muntolongo kaambo Joni walikumwaambilaanga kuteeti, “Tacili mumulawo yebo kukwata mwanakazi womuzyalwanyoko.”<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Kaambo kamajwi a Joni, Helodiyasi wakaba emfundiilili okuyanda kujaya Joni. Kono talikukonzya, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />kaambo Helodi walikuyoowa Joni. Walizi kuteeti uliluleme ape ulasalala, kaambo keeci walikumukwabilila. Helodi Walikuyandisisya kumumvwa nekuteegwa nako yoonse amumvwa walikukatazigwa loko.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Kumamanino Helodiyasi wakaba ecoolwe. Bwali buzuba bokusekelela kuzyalwa kwa Helodi. Helodi wakapanga mukiti okwiita bolupati-pati mumfulumende, abolupati-pati babasilumamba, abasololeli boku Galileya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Nibali kusekelela, mwanaa Helodiyasi musimbi wakanjila okuzozyana okubotezya Helodi abeenzu bakwe, mpoonyina mwami wakamwaambila kuteeti, “Ndaambile kufumbwa coyanda, ndilakupa.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Helodi wakakonka kuteeti, “Ndilakupa kufumbwa cotikumbile, naanga kukwaandwida bwami bwangu akati!”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Mpoonyina ooyu musimbi wakainka okuyobuzya banyina kuteeti, “Ndikumbile nzi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Bakamutaba kuteeti, “Mutwe wa Joni Mubbabbatizi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Cokufwaambana musimbi wakapiluka kumwami okuyookumbila kuteeti, “Ndiyanda mutwe wa Joni Mubbabbatizi inawa-inawa mumukeke!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Eeci cakausisya mwami loko, kono talikuyanda kumukakila kaambo kokukonka kwakakonka kunembo lya beenzu bakwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Mpoonyinaawo Helodi wakaambila mulindizi kuteeti eete mutwe wa Joni. Mulindizi wakazwa okwiinka muntolongo okuyootimbula mutwe wa Joni. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Mutwe wakwe wakaweta mumukeke okuupa musimbi mpoonyina wakakuupa banyina. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Basikwiiya ba Joni nibakamvwa, bakeza okuzobweza mubili wakwe okuyouzika.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Wasanina Baalumi Bali Zyuulu Zyosanwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateyo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Joni 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Mpoonyina baapositola bakapiluka okubunganina Jesu, okumwaambila zyoonse zibakakucita azibakaiisya. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Kwali bantu banji loko balikuza okuzwa kwateni, cokuteeti Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe bakabula eciindi cokulya. Mpoonyina wakabaambila kuteeti, “Mulicesu katiya kucibaka cimbi kotutikabe atulike kuteegwa mujane nako yokupumuna.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Mpoonyina bakanjila mumugolo mulicabo okutalikizya kwiinka kucibaka cuumwine kobakonzya kuyooba abalike.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Kono bantu banji bakababona nibalikuzwa okubaziba, mpoonyina bakazuza kuzwa mumataindi oonse okubaindila kubalikwiinka. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Myeelwe 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Bami 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2 Makani 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Ezekelo 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mateyo 9:36</ref>.</char></note>Jesu naakazwa mumugolo wakiibona eeyi mbunga mpati, wakabafwida mangʼeke kaambo bali mbuli mbelele zitajesi mweembezi. Mpoonyina wakatalika kubaiisya zintu zinji. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Kujolezya, basikwiiya bakwe bakamuzida okwaamba kuteeti, “Nako yainka loko ape ecino cibaka cilikule abantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Tuyeeya kuteeti niwabaambila bantu kuteeti bainke mumiinzi otuunzi tulaafwiifwi kuteeti bakalyuulile zyokulya.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Kono Jesu wakataba kuteeti, “Ndinywenya nywebo amubape zyokulya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Bakamubuzya kuteeti, “Ino waamba kuteegwa tubelesye miwayawaya ye nsiliva<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yobile Muci Giliki kuli Dinali. Eeci caamba muwayowayo wansiliva waciloma weelene ambwakonzya kuhola muntu muzuba bomwi. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Madinali aali myaanda yobile aleelene ambwakonzya kuhola muntu mumyeezi iili ciloba.</char></note> ili myaanda yobile kuula cinkwa cokusanina bantu aaba na?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakababuzya kuteeti, “Mujesi zinkwa zyongayi? Kamuya mukabone.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Nibakaakulanga, bakazomwaambila kuteeti, “Zili zyosanwe enswi zyobile.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Kuzwaawo Jesu wakaambila basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti bakazike bantu mutubunga-bunga abwizu buteteete. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Mpoonyina bantu bakakala mbwakaamba mutubunga-bunga twamwaanda, bamwi twamakumi osanwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakabweza zinkwa zyosanwe enswi zyobile, okulanga kujulu okulumba Leza. Wakakomoona zinkwa okupa basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti baabanye bantu. Mpoonyina wakabweza nswi zyobile okubaabanya boonse. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Boonse bakalya okukuta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Kuzwaawo, basikwiiya bakwe bakabwezelela zizuma zili kumi ezyobile zyezilyo zyakasyaala. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Baalumi bakalya bali zyuulu zyosanwe kutabalilizya banakazi abana.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Weenda Amaanzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mateyo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Joni 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Kuzwaawo, cokufwambaana Jesu naacilikumwaisya bantu wakaambila basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti banjile mumugolo kuteegwa batalikile kwiinka ku Betisaida, mutala limwi lyo lwizi. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Naakamanisya kulaizyanya abantu wakainka acilundu kuyookomba. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Kujolezya mugolo wali akati kolwizi, we wacili ankomwe alike. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Wakabona kuteeti basikwiiya bakwe balimukupenga kukwasula mugolo, kaambo ke guwo lyalikubaungila. Kuseeni-seeni loko wakeza kulibo kayobweenda atalaamaanzi. Watikabaindilile, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49-50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49-50" />kono nibakamubona kayobwenda atalaamaanzi, boonse bakayoowa loko okutalika kukwiila kaambo balikuteeti ndi saku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:49-50">Kono mpoonyinaawo Jesu wakabaambila kuteeti, “Mutazwi myoyo! Mutayowi! Ndime.” <verse eid="MRK 6:49-50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Mpoonyina wakanjila mumugolo mubalikubede, eguwo lyakamana. Basikwiiya bakwe bakakomokwa loko <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />kaambo taakwe nibakamvwisisisya zyamaleele aazinkwa Jesu zyaakasanizya bantu, kaambo kokuyuma kwemyoyo yabo.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waponya Bacisidwe mu Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mateyo 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Mpoonyina Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe bakazubuka lwizi okusika kunyika yoku Genesaleti, kubakakwaangilila mugolo ankomwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Bacizwa feela kumugolo, bantu bakamuziba Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Mpoonyina bakazuzana cilalaanda coonse kabayobwaambilizya kuteeti Jesu kwali. Kufumbwa kubamvwa kuteeti kwabede, balikumutolela bantu bacisidwe kabalede amalo aabo. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Kufumbwa kwaali kwiinka Jesu, mumiinzi, mumataindi, naanga mumyuunda okumisika, bantu balikumutolela bacisidwe okumukumbila kuteeti balwazi bakume feela kumamanino ejansi lyakwe. Mpoonyina boonse bakakuma kwateni bakapona.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Mulawo wa Leza Otunsiya-nsiya Twabantu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mateyo 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Kuzwaawo bamwi Bafalisi abamayi bo Mulawo bakazwida ku Jelusalemu, bakabunganina Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Mpoonyina bakabona kuteeti bamwi basikwiiya bakwe balikulya kabatasalede kumaanza, kokuteeti taakwe nibakasambide kweendelana ecizo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cimwi cizo cibalikujesi ma Juda cokusanzya maanzaabo munzila imwi kabatana kulya. Balikusyoma kuteeti eci calikuyandika kuteegwa muntu asalale kweendelana ecizo cabo ape atambulike kuli Leza. Kono Cizuminano Ceciindi tacaambi kuteeti kuyandika kusamba kumaanza kufumbwa bayanda kulya kuteegwa batambulike kuli Leza. </char></note> caba Juda. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Bafalisi a Bamajuda bacilizya ziisyo zyabasikale. Tabakonzyi kulya kabatasambide kumaanza kweendelana ecizo cabo. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Ape taakwe nibalikulya bazwa kumusika kabatana kulisalazya. Balacilizya ziisyo zyabasikale zinji mbuli mbobeelede kusanzya nkomoki, zibiya, mikeke yolubulo amalo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mumwi mumalembo Ecigiliki takulembedwe kuteeti “amalo” kumamanino yaaka kampango. </char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Mpoonyina Bafalisi abamayi bo Mulawo bakabuzya Jesu kuteeti, “Ino niinzi basikwiiya bako tabacilili zyiisyo zyabasikale kono balya amaanza atasalede kweelana ecizo?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:13">Izaya 29:13</ref>.</char>
    </note> Jesu wakataba kuteeti, “Ano Izaya zyaakamusinsima zyanconzyo! Mulibasikupaupa amenso, mbuli mbwakalemba kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Aaba bantu balandikuteka emilomo yabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">kono myoyo yabo ilikule amebo loko.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Taakwe cebandikombela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">kaambo baiisya milawo yabantu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">mbulikuteeti njiyangu!’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Munyansya mulawo wa Leza okucilizya ziisyo zyabasikale benu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakazumanana kateeti, “Mukaka mulawo wa Leza kwiindila mukucenjela kwenu kuteegwa mucilizye ziisyo zyabasikale benu. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kulonga 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Detilonomo 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">Kulonga 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Levitiko 20:9</ref>.</char></note> Ede Mozesi wakalailila kuteeti, ‘Kuteka bauso abanyoko,’ ape ‘Kufumbwa utuka baisi naanga banyina weelede kujaigwa.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Kono mwiisya kuteeti na bantu kabajesi cebakonzya kubelesya kugwasya baisi naanga banyina, bacaambilizya kuteeti kobani, caamba kuteeti, ‘capegwa kuli Leza’, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />kokuteeti mwabakasya kugwasya bazyali. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Mwanoiisya okusiila bamwi ziisyo zyabasikale benu, musowela ambali majwi aa Leza. Ape zinji zyemucita zili namu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zintu Zisofwaazya Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mateyo 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakaita mbunga yabantu antoomwi ape okubaambila kuteeti, “Amuswiilizye noonseneni, mundimvwisisisye. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Taakwe cinjila mumuntu cizwaanze cipa kuteeti asofwaale, aati cizwa mumuntu.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Ulamatwi amvwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mumwi mumalembo Ecigiliki takamo kampango aaka. </char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Nakazwa mubantu okwiinka mungʼanda, basikwiiya bakwe bakamukumbila kuteeti abapandulwide eeci cikozyanyo. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Jesu wakababuzya kuteeti, “Anywebo taakwe nimwamvwisisisya mbuli bamwi na? Tamuzi kuteeti taakwe cinjila mumuntu cizwaanze cipa kuteeti asofwaale? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Ede tacinjili mumoyo kono cinjila mwida okuyoozwa.” Mukwaamba namu, Jesu walikwaambilizya kuteeti, zilyo zyoonse zilakonzya kuligwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Wakazumanana kateeti, “Cisofwaazya muntu ceeco cizwa mulinguwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Ede mukati, komoyo wo muntu, momuzwa mizezo mibi, bulale-lale, bubbi, obujayi, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />kucita bumambi, buunyu, okucita zibi zili zyoonse, bubeji, kutalikuteka, munyono, luvuyu, kulisumpula obufuba-fuba, <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />zibi zyoonse eezi zizwa mumuntu okumusofwaazya.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lusyomo lo Mwanakazi Wamasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mateyo 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakazwa fateni okwiinka kucilalaanda cilaafwiifwi etaindi pati lya Taila. Wakanjila mungʼanda, talikuyanda kuteeti bantu bazibe kuteegwa kwali, kono taakwe naakakonzya kulisisa. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Mwanakazi umwi waloomwana musimbi wakanjilidwe muuya mubi wakamvwa zya Jesu, mpoonya-mpoonya wakeza okuzoomufukamina. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Ooyu mwanakazi wali muzwamasi, wakazyalilwa mucilalaanda ca Fonisia mu Siliya. Wakakumbila Jesu kuteeti agwisye dimona mumwanaakwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakamutaba kuteeti, “Pili tusanine bana bakute, kaambo zilyo zyabana tazyeelede kusowela babwa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Mpoonyina wakamutaba kuteeti, “Simalelaangu, ede naanga babwa balalya buungululwa buzwa atafule alida bana.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakamwaambila kuteeti, “Kaambo wataba namu, piluka kungʼanda, uyojana muuya mubi wazwa mumwanaako musimbi!”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Mpoonyina naakakusika kungʼanda, wakakujana mwana wakwe ulilede abulo kaliibide omuuya mubi wazwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waponya Cimuumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakazwa kucilalaanda cizungulukide Taila okuyoinda mutaindi pati lya Sidoni. Kuzwaawo, wakaselela kuya kulwizi lwa Galileya kaya kucilalaanda ca Mataindi aali Kumi. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Kwali mwaalumi wakali cimuumu. Bamwi bantu bakamweeta kuli Jesu. Mpoonyina bakamukumbila kuteeti amukume amaanzaakwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakamugwisya abantu okumutola kumbali kuzwaawo wakamusyonka minwe mumatwi, okuswida, mpoonyina wakamujata kululimi mwaalumi ooyu. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Kuzwaawo wakalanga kujulu mpoonyina wakayeekesya, okwaamba kuteegwa, <char style="tl">“Efata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibbala lye “Efata” ci Alamaiki. Ooyu musyobo walikwaambolwa loko mucilalaanda ca Palestina muciindi ca Jesu.</char></note>,” </char> kokuteeti, “Sinkuka!”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Mpoonyinaawo matwi omwaalumi ooyu akasinkuka olulimi lwakwe lwakaangunuka okutalika kwamboola kabotu. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakalailila bantu kuteeti bataambili naanga muntu womwi zyacitika, mbwaalikuzumanana kubakasya kwaambila bantu, abo mbobakazumanana kwaambila bantu. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Bantu bakakomokwa loko okuteeti, “Zyoonseneni uzicita kabotu, mane ulaponya bacimuumu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Wasanina Bantu Bali Zyuulu Zyone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mateyo 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Taakwe nikwakainda nako ape kwakabungana bantu banji. Kaambo kokuteeti tibalikwe zyokulya, Jesu wakaita basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti baze kulinguwe okubaambila kuteeti, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Aaba bantu ndabamvwida mangʼeke kaambo kwamazuba otatwe tulilimwi, ape taakwe cokulya. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Kuteeti ndabaambila kuteegwa bapiluke kumaanda aabo enzala, balanetuka munzila kaambo bamwi bazwa kule.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Basikwiiya bakwe bakabuzya kuteeti, “Ino tulazijanayi zilyo muno munkanda zyokusanina bantu boonse aaba?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Jesu wakababuzya kuteeti, “Ino kuli zinkwa zyongayi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Bakamutaba kuteeti, “Ciloba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakaambila bantu kuteeti bakale ansi. Kuzwaawo wakabweza zinkwa ziliciloba, wakalumba Leza okuzikomoona. Mpoonyina wakapa basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti baabanye bantu, abo bakacita mboonyina mbubakaambilwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Balikujesi otuswi tuniini, Jesu naakamana kulumba wakaambila basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti ato batwaabanye bantu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8-9" />Boonse bakalya okukuta. Kwali bantu batakasike kuzyuulu zyone bakalya. Mpoonyina basikwiiya bakabwezelela zizuma ziliciloba zyezilyo zyakasyaala. Mpoonyina Jesu wakamwaisya bantu. <verse eid="MRK 8:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Mpoonya-mpoonya wakanjila mumugolo abasikwiiya bakwe okwiinka kubusena bwa Damanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bafalisi Bayanda Citondezyo Camaleele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mateyo 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mateyo 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luka 11:16</ref>.</char>
    </note> Bamwi Bafalisi bakeza kuli Jesu okutalika kukazyana anguwe. Mukuyanda kumuca, bakamukumbila kuteeti acite maleele kutondezya kuteeti uleenguzu zizwa kuli Leza.<verse eid="MRK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mateyo 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luka 11:29</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mpoonyina wakayeekesya loko mumoyo okuteeti, “Ino niinzi bantu bamazuba aano nebayandisya citondezyo camaleele? Nconzyo ndimwaambila kuteeti taakwe citondezyo cebaticitilwe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Mpoonyina wakabasiya okupiluka mumugolo okuzubukila kutala limwi lyo lwizi.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mimena ya Bafalisi eya Mwami Helodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mateyo 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Iino basikwiiya bakwe bakaluba kweeta cinkwa cikwene, banyamwide feela comwi mumugolo. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luka 12:1</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina Jesu wakabacenjezya kuteeti, “Amucenjele okumamela emimena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mumena musyobo we ngula iibelesegwa kufutumusya busu bokupangisya cinkwa okukondozya bukoko ezinywigwa zikola zimwi. Ma Juda bakalikubelesya bbala lyo “mumena” mumaambilambali apandulula kweembululwa munzila mbotu aibi. Jesu naakalibelesya awa walikwaamba Bafalisi o Helodi mbubalikuyembulula bantu okutasyoma kwabo. </char></note> ya Bafalisi eya Mwami Helodi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Mulicabo bakatalika kwaamboozyanya kuteeti, “Waamba namu kaambo tatukwe cinkwa.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Jesu walizi zibali kwaamba, mpoonyina wakababuzya kuteeti, “Ino niinzi nemwaamba nkani yokubula cinkwa? Aiino taakwe cemuzi naanga taakwe cemubwene? Ino mizeezo yenu ilalela na?” <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:21">Jelemiya 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:2">Ezekelo 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Maako 4:12</ref>.</char></note> Mulijesi menso ino niinzi tamuboni? Mulijesi matwi ino niinzi tamumvwi? Ino mwaluba <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />aalya nindakakomoona zinkwa zyosanwe kusanina bantu bali zyuulu zyosanwe? Ino mwakazuzya zizuma zyongayi zyezilyo zyakasyaala?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Bakamutaba kuteeti, “Zyali kumi ezyobile.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Ino nindakakomoona zinkwa zili ciloba kusanina bantu bali zyuulu zyone mwakazuzya zizuma zyongayi zyezilyo zyakasyaala?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Bakamutaba kuteeti, “Zyali ciloba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Jesu wakateeti, “Aino tamuna mvwisisisya na?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waponya Moofu ku Betisaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe nibakasika ku Betisaida, bamwi bantu bakeeta mwaalumi moofu kuli Jesu okumukumbila kuteeti amukume kuteegwa apone. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Jesu wakajatilila mwaalumi moofu kujanza okumugwisya mumuunzi. Naakamana kumubika mate mumenso wakamubika maanzaakwe okumubuzya kuteeti, “Ino kuli cobwene na?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Ooyu mwaalumi wakalanga-langa okutaba kuteeti, “Iiyi ndibwene bantu, nekuteegwa baboneka mbuli zisamu ziyobweendeenda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Ape Jesu wakamubika maanzaakwe amenso. Mpoonyina mwaalumi ooyu wakalangisisya mpoonyina menso aakwe akapona okutalika kubona kabotu. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Kuzwaawo Jesu wakamwaambila kuteeti ainke kungʼanda okumulailila kuteeti, “Utapilukili mumuunzi kuyaambila bantu zyacitika.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Waamba Kuteeti Jesu ngo Mesiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mateyo 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Mpoonyina Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe bakainka kumiinzi ilafwiifwi etaindi lye Sizeliya Filipi. Munzila wakababuzya kuteeti, “Ino bantu bandaamba kuteeti ndime ni?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 6:14-15">Maako 6:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Luka 9:7-8</ref>.</char>
    </note> Bakamutaba kuteeti, “Bamwi baamba kuteeti ndiwe Joni Mubbabbatizi, bamwi baamba kuteeti, ndiwe Elija Musinsimi, bamwi baamba kuteeti, uli umwi wabasinsimi beciindi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:68-69">Joni 6:68-69</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mpoonyina wakababuzya kuteeti, “Ino nywebo mundaamba kuteeti ndime ni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Pita wakataba kuteeti, “Ndiwe Mesiya.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakabalailila kuteeti bataambili muntu naanga omwi zyakwe.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waamba Zyolufu Okupenzegwa Kwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mateyo 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakatalika kwiisya basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti, “Mwanoo Muntu weelede kupenga loko okukakwa abamaalu, bapaizi basilutwe, abamayi bo Mulawo wa Leza. Uyoojaigwa kono kwaakwiinda mazuba otatwe uyoobuka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bajuda bo balikubala kufumbwa nako mubuzuba mbulikuteeti mbuzuba bukwene. Buzuba mbwaakafwa Jesu bwakabalwa kuteeti mbubwali bokusaanguna. Buzuba buzwide mbwaakakala mucuumbwe bwakabalwa kuteeti mbwabili. Cibela cobuzuba katana kubuka kuzwa kubafu cakabalwa kuteeti mbuzuba bwatatu. </char></note>” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Wakabasalazizya, mpoonyina Pita wakamutola kumbali okuyoomupatookela.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bajuda balikuyeeyela kuteeti Mesiya wabo uyooba mwami mupati utizozunde mbebalwana abo boonse. Takwe nibalikumuyeeyela kuteeti uzopenga okufwa. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Kono Jesu wakacebuka okulanga basikwiiya bakwe. Wakapatokela Pita kuteeti, “Zwaawa Satani! Mizeezo yako taiinsi ya Leza kono njobuntu!”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mateyo 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luka 14:27</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mpoonyina Jesu wakaita bbunga lyabantu abasikwiiya bakwe okubaambila kuteeti, “Na kuli uyanda kundicilila, aliimye zyayanda, anyamune ciingano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muciindi ca Jesu, muntu waatulwa kuteeti akankaminwe aciingano walikusungilizigwa kucinyamuna. Wali kucinyamuna paka mane kubusena kobayanda kuyomukankamina alicico. Jesu awa walikupandulula kuteeti kufumbwa muntu uyanda kuba mucilili wakwe weelede kulibambila kupenga okufwa kuteegwa amucilile. </char></note> cakwe okundicilila. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mateyo 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luka 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Joni 12:25</ref>.</char></note> Iino kufumbwa uyanda kufutula buumi bwakwe, uyoobusweekelwa, kono kufumbwa usweekelwa buumi bwakwe kaambo kangu a Makani Mabotu, uyoobufutula. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Ino inga muntu wajana mpindu nzi kuteeti nyika yoonse yaba yakwe kono wasweekelwa buumi butamani? Taakwe! <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Ino niinzi muntu canga wapa kuteegwa aboobuumi butamani ape? Taakwe! <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Kufumbwa uulisenda akaambo kangu ezyendiisya muliino nako akati kabantu basimamambe ababi, awe Mwanoo Muntu uzoolisenda kaambo kakwe aakuza mubulemu bwa Isi abangelo basalala.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Kuzwaawo Jesu wakazwida anembo okubaambila kuteeti, “Nconzyo ndamwaambila kuteeti, kobali bamwi baimvwaawa batayoofwi mane bakabone Bwami bwa Leza kabuza enguzu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusanduka Kobulemu Komubili wa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mateyo 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2 Pita 1:17-18</ref>.</char>
    </note> Nikwakainda mazuba aali cisambomwe, Jesu wakabweza Pita, Jemusi o Joni okubatola acilundu cilamfu kuteegwa bakabe abalike. Kabalangilide mubili wa Jesu wakasanduka, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />zizwato zyakwe zyakamweka, okutuba buu! Zyakatuba buu mbozitakonzi kutubizigwa omuntu muno munyika. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Mpoonyina basikwiiya bakwe botatwe bakabona Elija o Mozesi kabaamboola o Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Mpoonyina Pita wakaambila Jesu kuteeti, “Omwiiyi, cabota tuli kuno! Atupange tutungu totatwe, komwi kako, komwi ka Mozesi akomwi ka Elija.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />We abamwi bakaliyoowede loko cokuteeti taalizi caali kwaamba.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mateyo 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Maako 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luka 3:22</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mpoonyina kwakeza joba okubavumba boonse aceemvule cateni, mpoonyina kwakazwa jwi mujoba lyalikwaamba kuteeti, “Ooyu Mwanaangu uuyandika. Amumumvwide!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Mpoonyinaawo nibakalanga-langa, taakwe ngubakabona, aati feela Jesu nguwali abo.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Nibalikuseluka acilundu, Jesu wakabaambila kuteeti, “Mutakaambili muntu naanga omwi zimwabona, kusikila Mwanoo Muntu akubuka kuzwa kubafu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Bakaacilizya malailile aya, kono mulicabo bakatalika kuyaamboola nkani eeyi yokuteeti, “Ino kubuka kuzwa kubafu caamba nzi?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Malaki 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mateyo 11:14</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina bakabuzya Jesu kuteeti, “Ino niinzi bamayi bo Mulawo cebaamba kuteeti Elija nguweelede kusaanguna kuza Mesiya katana?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Wakataba kuteeti, “Mbombubo, Elija nguweelede kusaanguna kuza okubambulula zintu zyoonse. Ino niinzi Malembo naamba kuteeti Mwanoo Muntu uyoopenga loko okusulaikwa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Nconzyo ndimwaambila kuteeti, Elija wakeza kale, kono bantu bakamucita zyoonse zibi zyobali kuyanda kweendelana a Malembo mbwaamba zyakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Watanda Muuya Mubi Basikwiiya Ngubakacilwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mateyo 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Jesu abasikwiiya botatwe nibakaseluka acilundu bakajana basikwiiya bamwi balaakati kembunga yabantu kabakazyanya abamayi bo Mulawo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Bantu nibakamubona feela Jesu bakakomokwa loko, mpoonyina bakamuzuzila okumulumelesya. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Jesu wakabuzya basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti, “Ino mukazyanya nzi abo?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Umwi mwaalumi wali mubantu wakataba kuteeti, “Omwiiyi, ndakweetela mwanaangu kaambo unjilidwe muuya mubi ape taambooli. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Kufumbwa feela wamujata, ulamusuntusya, okuzwa kovu kumulomo ape okuluma ntwino omubili ulayuminina ntaa! Ndakumbide basikwiiya bako kuteeti bautande kono bakacilwa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakabaambila kuteeti, “Nywebo nobantu batakwe lusyomo, ino ndikale nako ndamfu buti andinywe? Ndilamulangilizya nako ndamfu buti? Amumweete kuno musyimani ooyo.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Bakamweeta kuli Jesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Muuya niwakabona feela Jesu, wakawisya musyimani ansi, okumusuntusya mpoonyina wakatalika kwaalabana, okuzwa kovu kumulomo. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakabuzya baisi kuteeti, “Ino wakala nako ndamfu buti kali namu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Bakateeti, “Kuzwa kubwana.” <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Ziindi zinji muuya mubi umusowela mumulilo omumaanzi kuyanda kumujaya. Tufwide mangʼeke okutugwasya na ulakonzya!<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Jesu wakateeti, “Ino niinzi nowaamba kuteeti, ‘Na ulakonzya’? Zyoonse zila konzeka kumuntu uusyoma.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Mpoonyinaawo baisi musyimani bakoongolola kuteeti, “Ndilasyoma aniini. Ndigwasye kuteeti ndisyome loko!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Jesu wakabona kuteeti mbunga yabantu yalikuyoobukomena okuyoobuswena afwiifwi ambabo, mpoonyina wakapatookela muuya mubi kuteeti, “Yebo omuuya wokutamvwa obucimuumu, ndikwaambila kuteeti, zwa mumusyimani ooyu utakapilukili ape mulinguwe!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Muuya wakakwiila, okusuntusya musyimani, okuzwa. Mpoonyina musyimani wakaboneka anga wafwa, cokuteeti bantu banji bakateeti, “Wafwa!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Kono Jesu wakajata musyimani kujanza okumugwasya kwiima, mpoonyina wakaima.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Kuzwaawo Jesu naakanjila mungʼanda, basikwiiya bakwe bakamubuzila kumbali kuteeti, “Ino niinzi capa kuteeti tukacilwe kuutanda muuya?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakataba kuteeti, “Ooyu muuya uuli namu inga watandwa feela kwiinda mukukomba.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ape Jesu Waamba Zyolufu Lwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mateyo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Kuzwaawo Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe bakazwa kwateni kucibaka eciya okuyoinda mu Galileya. Taalikuyanda kuteeti bantu bazibe kwali kubede, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />kaambo walikwiisya basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti, “Mwanoo Muntu uyoabwa mumaanza aabantu batikamujaye. Mpoonyina kwakwiinda mazuba otatwe uyoobuka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Kono basikwiiya bakwe taakwe nibakamvwisisisya zyaali kwaamba, kono balikuyoowa kumubuzya.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngwani Mupati Akati Kesu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateyo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Mpoonyina Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe bakeza ku Kapenaumu, nibakanjila mungʼanda wakababuzya kuteeti, “Ino mwalikukazyanya nzi munzila?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luka 22:24</ref>.</char>
    </note> Kono taakwe nibakamutaba kaambo balikukazyanya kuteeti na ngwani mupati loko alibo. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26-27">Mateyo 20:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:11">23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43-44">Maako 10:43-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luka 22:26</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina Jesu wakakala okwiita basikwiiya bakwe bali kumi abobile kuteeti baswene afwiifwi okubaambila kuteeti, “Kufumbwa uyanda kuba kunembo abe musule okuba mubelesi waboonse.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Wakabweza mwana muniini okumwiimika akati kabo. Wakamukumbata okwaamba kuteeti, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mateyo 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luka 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Joni 13:20</ref>.</char></note> “Kufumbwa utambula mwana uuli namu muzina lyangu watambula ndime, ape kufumbwa unditambula tatambuli ndime andilike kono antoomwi owakandituma.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufumbwa Utatulwani Tulilimwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Mpoonyina Joni wakaambila Jesu kuteeti, “Omwiiyi, twabona muntu walikutanda madimona muzina lyako, mpoonyina twamwaambila kuteeti aleke kaambo tali umwi wesu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Jesu wakataba kuteeti, “Mutasoli kumukasya, kaambo taakwe muntu unga kacita maleele muzina lyangu kwamana muciindi ciniini wasanduka okutalika kwaamba zibi alindime. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mateyo 12:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:23">Luka 11:23</ref>.</char></note> Kufumbwa utatulwani tulilimwi. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:42">Mateyo 10:42</ref>.</char></note> Ape ndimwaambila kuteeti, kufumbwa utikamupe maanzi okunywa kaambo kokuteeti mulibantu bangu nde Mesiya, nconzyo uyootambula bulumbu.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zintu Zilebya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mateyo 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Kufumbwa ulebya umwi waaba baniini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eci caamba mucilili wa Jesu ubede mbuli mwanamuniini (Maako 9:35-37, Mateyo 18:4-5). </char></note> basyoma mulindime, inga cabota kuteeti muntu ulinamu waangililwa ziyo pati munsingo okusowelwa mulwizi. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mateyo 5:30</ref>.</char></note> Nakuteeti janza lyako kalikulebya weelede kulitimbula! Kuli kabotu kuyoonjila mubuumi butamani ejanza lyomwi kwiinda kwiinka ku Gehena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibbala “Gehena” ndyaalikubelesya Jesu anoamba “mulilo utamani”. Eli lyalizina lyo kubali kusowela zidooti bomu Jelusalemu! Eci cali cigodi cilamfu cali afwiifwi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">O Jelusalemu cakazooba mokusowela zidooti zizwa mutaindi. Mulilo womwateni tiwali kuzima. Nikwakainda nako eli bbala lyakatalika kupandulula cibaka cecisubulo camamanino. </char></note>, kumulilo utamani amaanza obile. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />[Ooko mvwinyu zibalya tazifwi omulilo uubatenta tuuzimi.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amwi malembo Ecigiliki akalembelwa musule ngaajesi kampango aaka. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Nakuteeti gulu lyako kalikulebya weelede kulitimbula! Kuli kabotu kuyoonjila mubuumi butamani egulu lyomwi kwiinda kusowelwa mu Gehena amaulu obile. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />[Ooko mvwinyu zibalya tazifwi omulilo uubatenta tuuzimi.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amwi malembo Ecigiliki akalembelwa musule ngaajesi kampango aaka.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mateyo 5:29</ref>.</char></note> Nakuteeti liinso lyako kalikulebya weelede kuligwisya! Kuli kabotu kunjila mu Bwami bwa Leza eliinso lyomwi kwiinda kusowelwa mu Gehena ameenso obile. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:24">Izaya 66:24</ref>.</char></note> Ooko mvwinyu zibalya tazifwi omulilo uubatenta tuuzimi.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Mbuli cilyo mbocibikwa sautu, mbwenya namu boonse bayoobotesegwa omulilo wamapenzi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mucigiliki kulembedwe kuteeti: “Boonse bayosansailwa sautu womulilo.” </char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mateyo 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14:34-35</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Sautu ndibbotu, kono kuteeti lyasampuka, ino inga mwalicita buti kuteeti linone ape?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Amube osautu mulindinywe okukala muluumuno umwi oumwi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Inkani Yokulekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mateyo 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Jesu wakazwa ooko okwiinka kucooko ce Judiya okuyozubuka mulonga wa Jolodani. Mpoonyina bantu banji bakamubunganina ape, wakabaisya mbuli lyoonse.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Bafalisi bamwi bakamuzida kuteeti bazomuce kabateeti, “Twaambile, ino Mulawo wesu ulazumizya mwaalumi kuleka mwanakazaakwe na?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Jesu wakabataba kuteeti, “Ino Mozesi wakamulailila kutiinzi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Detilonomo 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mateyo 5:31</ref>.</char>
    </note> Bakataba kuteeti, “Wakazumizya kuteeti, mwaalumi inga walembela mwanakazaakwe lugwalo lokulekana okumuleka kuteeti ainke.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Jesu wakabaambila kuteeti, “Mozesi wakamulembela mulawo ooyu kaambo muleenkazi. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Kono kuzwa kumatalikilo Leza naakalenga zintu, ‘wakalenga mwaalumi omwanakazi.’ <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Matalikilo 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Kaambo keeci, ‘Mwaalumi ulasiya baisi abanyina okukakatila kumwanakazaakwe, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />mpoonyina bobile balaba muntu omwi.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Matalikilo 2:24</ref>.</char></note> Kokuteeti tabacili bobile kono omwi. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Mpoonyina eeco Leza caakaswaanya muntu atacaanzaanyi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Nibakapiluka mungʼanda, basikwiiya bakwe bakamubuzya fateni ankani eeyi ape. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakabaambila kuteeti, “Kufumbwa uleka mwanakazaakwe okukwata umbi wacitila mwanakazaakwe bumambe. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mateyo 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1 Bakolinto 7:10-11</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Mbwenya namu awe mwanakazi uuzwa mungʼanda yakwe okukwatwa kumbi wacita bumambe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waleleka Bana Baniini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mateyo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Bamwi bantu balikweeta bana baniini kuli Jesu kuteeti azobabike maanzaakwe amitwe okubaleleka, mpoonyina basikwiiya ba Jesu bakanyemena bantu aaba. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Jesu naakabona namu wakanyema okwaambila basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti, “Amubaleke bana baniini baze kulindime, mutabakasyi kaambo Bwami bwa Leza mbwabantu babede mbulimbabo. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mateyo 18:3</ref>.</char></note> Ndimusyomezya kuteeti kufumbwa utikacilwe kutambula Bwami bwa Leza mbuli mwana muniini takoyonjila mwateni.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Mpoonyina wakabakumbata okubika maanza ali umwi oumwi okubaleleka.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muvubi o Bwami bwa Leza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateyo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Jesu naalikutalika musinzo wakwe, kwakamuzuzila mwaalumi okumufukamina, wakamubuzya kuteeti, “Omwiiyi mubotu, ndeelede kucita buti kuteeti nditambule buumi butamani?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Jesu wakamutaba kuteeti, “Ino niinzi nondiita kuteegwa mubotu? Taakwe mubotu aati feela Leza. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Kulonga 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Detilonomo 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:14">Kulonga 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Detilonomo 5:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:15">Kulonga 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:19">Detilonomo 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:16">Kulonga 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:20">Detilonomo 5:20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kulonga 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Detilonomo 5:16</ref>.</char></note> Ede uliizi milawo, ‘Utajayi, utaciti bumambe, utabbi, utabejekezyi umwi kaambo, utabeji, kuteka bauso abanyoko.’”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Mwaalumi wakataba kuteeti, “Omwiiyi, yoonse eeyi milawo ndakaicilizya kuzwa kubwana.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Jesu wakamulanga coluyando okumwaambila kuteeti, “Uyandika feela kucita cintu comwi, koya ukauzye zintu zyako zyoonse, mpoonyina mali ukape bapengede notikabe obuvubi kujulu. Wazwaawo uze undicilile.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Ooyu mwaalumi naakamvwa namu wakatyompwa, wakainka kauside kaambo walivubide loko.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakalanga-langa basikwiiya bakwe okubaambila kuteeti, “Cintu ciyumu loko kubantu bavubide kuyoonjila mu Bwami bwa Leza!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Basikwiiya bakakomokwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Majuda beeyo nako balikuyeya kuteeti buvubi ciitondezyo cokuteeti muntu ulilelekedwe o Leza. Balikuyeeya kuteeti muntu uvubide tayosyupeki kunjila kujulu. Kono Jesu wakaiisya kuteeti ziindi zinji buvubi inga businkilizya muntu kuteeti kaendelana o Leza, kaambo tasyomi muli Leza kono usyoma mubuvubi. </char></note> nibakamvwa majwi aya, kono Jesu wakaindilizya okwaamba kuteeti, “Bana bangu, cintu ciyumu loko kunjila mu Bwami bwa Leza! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Cintu cuuba nkamela kwiinda muliinso lyendonga, kwiinda muntu uvubide kunjila mu Bwami bwa Leza.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Basikwiiya nibakamvwa namu, bakakomokwa loko okutalika kubuzyanya kuteeti, “Ino mpoonyina ngwani ukonzya kufutulwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Jesu wakabalanga okubaambila kuteeti, “Eeci kubantu tacikonzeki kono kuli Leza cilakonzeka, kaambo zyoonse zilakonzeka kuli Leza.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Mpoonyina Pita wakaambila Jesu kuteeti, “Langa! Twakasiya zintu zyoonse okukucilila.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Jesu wakabaambila kuteeti, “Iiyi, iino ndimwaambila kuteeti, kufumbwa usiya ngʼanda, naanga bazyalwanyina, naanga bacizi, naanga banyina, naanga baisi, naanga bana, naanga myuunda kaambo kangu a Makani Mabotu, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />uyootambula loko muluuno musela, myaanda-myaanda yamaanda, yabazyalwanyina, yabacizi, yamanyina, yabana, ayemyuunda ape ayokupenzegwa. Mpoonyina mumusela uza uyootambula buumi butamani. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mateyo 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luka 13:30</ref>.</char></note> Kono banji balikunembo bayojanika musule, ape banji balimusule bayojanika kunembo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waamba Lufu Lwakwe Katatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mateyo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe balimunzila kabaya ku Jelusalemu. Walikuyoobweenda kunembo lyabo, kabakomokedwe loko. Bantu balikuyoobumucilila musule baliyoowede. Mpoonyina ape Jesu wakaitila basikwiiya bakwe bali kumi abobile kumbali okubaambila ziyanda kumucitikila. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Wakabaambila kuteeti, “Amuswiilizye, aawa tuya ku Jelusalemu, Mwanoo Muntu kwayoabwa mumaanza aba paizi basilutwe abamayi bo Mulawo. Bayoomwaatula kuteeti ajaigwe okumwaaba mumaanza abamasi, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />bayoomufubazika okumuswida okumukwabboola okumujaya kono kwaakwiinda mazuba otatwe uyoobuka kuzwa kubafu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukumbila Kwa Jemusi o Joni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mateyo 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Jemusi o Joni bana ba Zebbediya, bakainka kuli Jesu okumwaambila kuteeti, “Omwiiyi kuli zetuyanda kuteeti utucitile.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Wakababuzya kuteeti, “Ndimucitile nzi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Bakateeti, “Wakukala acibbula cako co Bwami cobulemu, tuyanda kuteeti umwi wesu akakale kululyo lwako umwi kucigoyo cako.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:50">Luka 12:50</ref>.</char>
    </note> Jesu wakataba kuteeti, “Tamuzi zemukumbila. Ino nkomoki yamapenzi njendeelede kunywa, inga mwainywa na? Naanga lubbabbatizyo lwamapenzi lwaandoondicitikila, inga mwalukonzya na?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Bakateeti, “Iyii tulakonzya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Mpoonyina Jesu wakabataba kuteeti, “Mbombubo nkomoki yamapenzi njendeelede kunywa, muyooinywa, naanga lubbabbatizyo lwamapenzi lwaandoondicitikila, luyoomucitikila. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Kono tandikwe nguzu zyokusala uyokala kululyo lwangu okucigoyo cangu. Leza nguyopa ezyo zibbula kulimbakabambila.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Aabo bamwi basikwiiya nibakamvwa nkani eeyi, bakanyemena Jemusi o Joni. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25-26">Luka 22:25-26</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina Jesu wakabaitila antoomwi boonse okubaambila kuteeti, “Mulizi, aabo baitwa kuteeti mbami Bamasi balela bantu babo cokudyaminina, ape abasololi babelesya nguzu zyabo kuteeti babacilile. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mateyo 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Maako 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luka 22:26</ref>.</char></note> Kono tacili namu kulindinywe. Uuyanda kuba mupati akati kenu, weelede kuba mubelesi wenu. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Uuyanda kuba kunembo, weelede kuba muzike waboonse. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Ndimwaambila namu kaambo naanga Mwanoo Muntu taakwe naakazida kuzobelekelwa, kono wakazida kuzobelekela bamwi okupa buumi bwakwe kuteeti anunune bantu banji.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waponya Moofu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateyo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Kuzwaawo Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe bakeza kutaindi pati lye Jeliko. Nibalikuzwa kwateni abantu banji, umwi moofu sikukumbila uutegwa Bbatimeyo, mwanaa Timeyo walikede mumbali enzila. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Naakamvwa kuteeti ngu Jesu woku Nazaleta, wakatalika koongolola kateeti, “Jesu Mwanaa Deveti, ndifwide kwateni mangʼeke!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Bantu banji bakamupatookela okumwaambila kuteeti aumune. Kono we naakoongololesya kuteeti, “Mwanaa Deveti, ndifwide kwateni mangʼeke!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Jesu wakaima okwaamba kuteeti, “Amumwiite.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Mpoonyina bakamwiita mwaalumi moofu, kabateeti kulinguwe, “Botelwa! Nyamuka! Ulakwiita.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Wakasowa jansi lyakwe okusotoka, mpoonyina wakavwalooka kuza kuli Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Jesu wakamubuzya kuteeti, “Ino uyanda kuteeti ndikucitile nzi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Wakataba kuteeti, “Omwiiyi wangu, ndiyanda kuteeti ndibonaape.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Jesu wakamwaambila kuteeti, “Koya, lusyomo lwako lwakuponya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Mpoonyinaawo wakakonzya kubona, okucilila Jesu munzila.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Watambulwa mu Jelusalemu Cobulemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateyo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Joni 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe nibakaswena afwiifwi o Jelusalemu, kumbali omuunzi wa Betifage owa Bbetaniya a Cilundu ca Oliva<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ooyu musyobo wecisamu cizyala mucelo wa oliva. Mucelo wa oliva muniini ulimbuli ntumbulwa uleenseke ziyumu. Mucelo wa oliva walimucelo walikuyandika loko mumazuba eciindi. Walikusinwa okupanga mafuta ookujisya ookubelesya mubukombi busiyene-siyene. Mafuta ateni alikubeleka muma lampi omumisamu yokusilisya ape okubotya mubili. </char></note>, Jesu wakatuma bobile ali basikwiiya bakwe <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />kuteeti, “Kamuya kumuunzi ulaanembo. Muciyoosika feela, muyoojana mbongolo yaangidwe acisamu itana beleka. Mukayaangunune mpoonyina muyeete kuno. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Na umwi amubuzye kuteeti, ‘Ino niinzi nemucita namu?’ Mumwaambile kuteeti, ‘Mwami ulaiyanda. Kono ulaipilusya inawa.’”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Mpoonyina bakainka okuyoojana mbongolo munzila kayaangilidwe kumanjililo engʼanda. Nibali kuyaangununa, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />bamwi balikwiimvwi aawo bakababuzya kuteeti, “Ino mucita nzi? Ino muyaangunwida nzi mbongolo?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Bakabataba mboonyina mbwaakabaambilide Jesu. Mpoonyina aabo bantu bakabazumizya kuteeti baitole. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Bakayeeta kuli Jesu, okuyala zizwaato zyabo amunsana wayo, mpoonyina wakatanta fateni. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Bantu banji balikuyoobuyala zizwaato zyabo munzila bamwi kabatyola ntabi zyamalala mumyuunda okuziyala munzila. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Intembauzyo 118:25-26</ref>.</char></note> Bantu bali kunembo lyakwe abali kuyoobumucilila musule, bakatalika koongoolola kuteeti, “Hosana!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hosana ndibbala lyomuci Hibbulu lyaamba kuteeti, “Tufutule” Libelesegwa banoongolola kulumbaizya Leza.</char></note> Ulilelekedwe ooyo uza muzina lyo Mwami! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Bulilelekedwe Bwami buza bwa tata Deveti, sikale wesu. Hosana kuli uuli kujulu lyamajulu!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Jesu wakanjila mu Jelusalemu okwiinka mulabba lye ngʼanda ya Leza, wakalanga-langa zintu zyoonse. Mukuteeti nako yaliinkide, wakainka ku Bbetaniya abasikwiiya bakwe bali kumi abobile.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukuyu Uutakwe Micelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mateyo 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Nibwakaca Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe kabayoobuzwa ku Bbetaniya, wakafwa nzala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Aleele wakabona cisamu comukuyu cavuzyenye maani, mpoonyina wakainka kwateni kuyobona na cilizyede. Kono naakasika wakajana maani feela, kaambo nako yenkuyu tiyalina sika. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Jesu wakaambila cisamu kuteeti, “Kutakabi utakalye nkuyu zyako ape!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Basikwiiya bakwe bakamumvwa caakaamba.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Watanda Basikuuzya Mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mateyo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Joni 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Nibakasika ku Jelusalemu, Jesu wakainka mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza okutanda boonse bali kuula okuuzya. Wakapindamuna matafule aabasikupindula mali otubbula twabasikuuzya nkwilimba,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Mulabba” Ngʼanda ya Leza yakajesi buyake bwe Ngʼanda ya Leza, obulambo elabba lyakiizingulukide. Mubupanduluzi oobu, “Ngʼanda ya Leza” cigaminina lyaamba labba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza. Bantu tebali kuswaananina mubuyake bwe Ngʼanda ya Leza bweni-bweni, kaambo kwalikuzumizigwa feela bapaizi kunjila mwateni.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />ape taakwe unyamwide cintu ngwakazumizya kwiinda mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Izaya 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jelemiya 7:11</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina wakaiisya bantu kuteeti, “Kulilembedwe mu Malembo kuteeti Leza wakateeti, ‘Ngʼanda yangu iyoitwa kuteeti ningʼanda yokukombela ya bantu bemisyobo yoonse munyika.’ Kono mwaisandula kuba ciyubilo cababbi!”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Bapaizi basilutwe abamayi bo Mulawo bakazimvwa zyakacitika, mpoonyina bakatalika kulangoola nzila yokuteeti bajaye Jesu. Balikumuyoowa kaambo wakomosezye bantu boonse ambwaisya.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Kujolezya Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe bakazwa mu Jelusalemu.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ciiyo Kuzwa Kucisamu Comukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mateyo 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Mujunzoonza nibalikuyoobweenda munzila, bakabona ciya cisamu comukuyu kaciyumide kuzwa kumiyanda. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Pita wakayeeya zyakacitika, mpoonyina wakaambila Jesu kuteeti, “Omwiiyi, bona! Cisamu comukuyu ciwakafwiza cayuma!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakabataba kuteeti, “Amusyome muli Leza! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mateyo 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Bakolinto 13:2</ref>.</char></note> Ndimusyomezya kuteeti kufumbwa waambila cilundu eeci kuteeti, ‘Nyukuka okulifusila mulwizi,’ ape kuteeti katazumboozyi mumoyo kono kasyoma kuteeti zyaamba zilacitika, ulacitilwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Kaambo keeci ndamwaambila kuteeti, mwanokomba okukumbila zintu, musyome kuteeti mwatambula kale, mpoonyina muyopegwa kufumbwa cimwakumbila. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14-15">Mateyo 6:14-15</ref>.</char></note> Ape mwanookomba, mweelede kujatila zibi zyoonse zibakamubisizya bamwi kuteegwa uso uuli kujulu amujatile zibi zemwakacita. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Kono kuteeti na tamujatili bamwi, awe uso woku julu takomujatila milandu yenu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amwi malembo taajesi kancali aaka.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubuzyo we Nguzu Zya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateyo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Ape Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe bakeza ku Jelusalemu. Jesu naalikuyoobweenda mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza, bapaizi basilutwe, bamayi bo Mulawo abamaalu bakamuzida <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />okumubuzya kuteeti, “Ninguzu nzi zyobelesya kucita zintu eezi? Ngwani wakakupa zizyo?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Jesu wakabataba kuteeti, “Pili ndimubuzye mubuzyo omwi, mwanditaba, ndilamwaambila nguzu zyondibelesya kucita zintu eezi. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Ino nguzu zya Joni zyokubbabbatizya zyakazwida kujulu na kubantu? Amunditabe!”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Bakatalika kukazyanya mulicabo kuteeti, “Ino tulataba buti? Twataba kuteeti, ‘Zyakazwa kuli Leza,’ ulaamba kuteeti, ‘Ino niinzi nimwatakamusyoma Joni?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ape inga twaamba buti kuteeti, ‘Zizwa kubantu’?” Balikuyoowa dwi lyabantu kaambo boonse balikusyoma kuteeti Joni wali musinsimi wenconzyo. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Bakamutaba kuteeti, “Tatuzi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Mpoonyina Jesu wakabaambila kuteeti, “Ano amebo tandikomwaambila nguzu zyondibelesya kucita zintu eezi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Cikozyanyo Cabalimi Babi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateyo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1-2">Izaya 5:1-2</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mpoonyina Jesu wakabaiisya kwiinda muzikozyanyo wakateeti, “Kwali mwaalumi wakabyala muunda womusaansa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cokusinina nsaansa cama Juda cakajesi zibaka zyobile zyakasidwe mubbwe, cimwi cali mujulu, muzyali kusininwa nsaansa kabalyatooka amaulu, cimwi calaansi mwali kulokela musinza. </char></note> okuuyakila cilabba, wakasya mugodi wokusinina mwateni nsaansa okuyaka ngalani yomulindizi. Mpoonyina ooyu muunda wakuusiila balimi kuteeti baweendelezye kuteegwa bapanga mpindu kabaabana anguwe. Mpoonyina wakainka mumusinzo. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Niyakasika nako yokukutula, wakatuma muzike wakwe kuteeti akamubwezele caabilo cakwe kubalimi. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Aaba balimi bakamujata okumuuma loko, okumupilusya cinkwa maanza. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Ape wakatuma umwi muzike, ooyu balimi bakamuuma kumutwe okumusampoola. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Mpoonyina wakatuma umbi, ooyu bakamujaya. Abamwi banji mbaakali kutuma bakacitwa mbwenya namu, bamwi balikuumwa bamwi balikujaigwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Kwakazosyala feela omwi wokutuma, ooyu wali mwana wakwe muyandisi. Kumamanino wakatuma nguwe kayeeya kuteeti, ‘Nconzyo bayoomukuteka mwanaangu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Kono bo bakaamboozyanya kuteeti, ‘Ooyu ngoswaana. Amuze tumujaye kuteegwa muunda tuubweze!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Mpoonyina bakamujata okumujaya, mubili wakwe bakausowela anzoomuunda.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Jesu wakabuzya kuteeti, “Ino mwini muunda uzocita buti? Uzooza okubajaya mpoonyina okuupa balimi bamwi kuteeti baweendelezye muunda wakwe. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Intembauzyo 118:22-23</ref>.</char></note>Ino taakwe nimwakaabala Malembo aamba kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Bbwe ndibakakaka bayaki kuteeti talikwe musebezi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">lyakaba ndeliyandisi kwiinda oonse kuyumya ntalisyo ye ngʼanda.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Mwami nguwakacipanga namu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">catukomosya loko!’?”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Iino basololi ba Majuda nibakamvwa namu, bakasoleka kwaanga Jesu kaambo bakaziba kuteeti mucikozyanyo eeci walikwaamba mbabo. Kono bakayoowa bantu, mpoonyina bakamusiya okwiinka.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubuzyo Wokutela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateyo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Kuzwaawo bamwi Bafalisi a bana Helodi bakatumwa kuli Jesu kuteeti bazomuce mukwaamboola. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Bakamuzida okumwaambila kuteeti, “Omwiiyi, tulizi kuteeti inga waambanga zyencozyo, topengani azyebayeeya bantu. Wiisya bantu luyando lwa Leza lwenconzyo kotasalululi. Twaambile na cililuleme mu Mulawo wesu kutela kuli Kaisala Muleli Mupati waba Loma? Katutela na nee?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Kono Jesu wakaziba kuteeti mibuzyo yabo njolweeno, mpoonyina wakabataba kuteeti, “Ino niinzi nemusola kundica? Amundeetele kadibilisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aka kadinali, kakali komuwaya-waya keci Loma kakabambidwe ensiliva. Kakalikubelesegwa ama Juda kukubbadela mutelo wa mfulumende ya Ciloma. Kadinali kakajesi zina omutwe wa Kaisala. </char></note> ndikabone.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Bakamweetela mpoonyina wakabuzya kuteeti, “Ino cifwanikiso eeci ezina zizyani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Bakamutaba kuteeti, “Zyomuleli Mupati Kaisala.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakateeti, “Kaisala mumupe zyakwe, o Leza mumupe zyakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Mpoonyina bakamukomokwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubuzyo Wokubuka Kubafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateyo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Misebezi 23:8</ref>.</char>
    </note> Kuzwaawo bamwi Basaduki bakeza kuli Jesu. Basaduki baamba kuteeti bantu tabayoobuki kuzwa kubafu. Nibakasika bakamwaambila kuteeti, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Detilonomo 25:5</ref>.</char></note>“Omwiiyi, Mozesi wakatulembela Mulawo wokuteeti: ‘Na mwaalumi wafwa katazyede, muzyalwanyina womufu weelede kukwata mukamufu okuzyalila mufu bana.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Imwi nako kwali baalumi bali ciloba bazyedwaamwi. Mupati wakakwata okufwa katakwe mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Mpoonyina walikumucilila wakakwata mukamufu, anguwe wakafwa katakwe mwana. Okuliwatatu mbweenya namu, <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />mane boonse bakamana. Kumamanino mwanakazi awe wakafwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Ino bakubuka bafu, ooyu mwanakazi uyoba wani? Kaambo boonse bali ciloba balikumukwete.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Jesu wakataba kuteeti, “Mulisweekede kaambo tamweezi Malembo enguzu zya Leza. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Bafu baakubuka takuyoobi zyokukwata, banooli mbuli bangelo kujulu. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kulonga 3:6</ref>.</char></note> Ede muliizi kale nkani yokubusigwa kwabafu. Ino taakwe nimwakalibala bbuku lya Mozesi, ankani ye citeyo calikuyaka? Kulembedwe kuteeti Leza wakaambila Mozesi kuteeti, ‘Ndime Leza wa Abbulahamu, Leza wa Isaka ape o Leza wa Jakobo.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Ngu Leza wabaumi, tainsi Leza wabafu. Mulisweekede loko!”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulawo Mupati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mateyo 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Umwi mwiiyi wo Mulawo waliwo wakamvwa zibalikukazyanya. Wakabona kuteeti Jesu wakabataba kabotu ba Saduki, mpoonyina wakamubuzya kuteeti, “Ino Mulawo nzi mupati kwiinda yoonse?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:4-5">Detilonomo 6:4-5</ref>.</char>
    </note> Jesu wakateeti, “Mulawo mupati kwiinda yoonse, ngooyu ‘Swiilizya, Izilaili! Mwami Leza wesu ngo Mwami alike. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Yanda Mwami Leza wako omoyo wako woonse, omuuya wako woonse, emizeezo yako yoonse enguzu zyako zyoonse.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Levitiko 19:18</ref>.</char></note> Ucilila mubupati waamba kuteeti: ‘Yanda muntunyoko mboonyina mboliyanda.’ Taakwe uumbi mulawo mupati kwiinda eeyi yobile.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:35">Detilonomo 4:35</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mwiiyi wo Mulawo wakaambila Jesu kuteeti, “Waamba kabotu omwiiyi! Zyanconzyo zyowaamba, zyokuteeti Mwami Leza alike ngo Leza, ape taakwe Leza umbi kunze lyakwe. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hosia 6:6</ref>.</char></note> Weelede kuyanda Leza omoyo wako woonse, emizeezo yako yoonse, enguzu zyako zyoonse. Ape yanda muntunyoko mboonyina mboliyanda. Eeyi njemilawo mipati, kwiinda kweeta banyama kuteeti batentwe acipaililo okupa zipaizyo zimwi kuli Leza.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>.</char>
    </note> Jesu naakabona kuteeti wataba cobusongo, wakamwaambila kuteeti, “Tolikule Obwami bwa Leza”.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Kuzwa aawo, taakwe wakasola kubuzya Jesu mubuzyo.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubuzyo Wazya Mesiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mateyo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Jesu naalikwiisya mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza, wakabuzya kuteeti, “Ino baamba nzi bamayi bo Mulawo banoteeti Mesiya uyoozwa kulunyungu lwa Mwami Deveti? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Intembauzyo 110:1</ref>.</char></note> Muuya Uusalala wakapa kuteeti Mwami Deveti we aambe kuteeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Mwami wakaambila Mwami wangu kuteeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">kala kubbazu lyolulyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mucizo caba Juda, kuteeti na mwami waambila muntu kukala kululyo lwakwe, citondezya bulemu antoomwi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Enguzu. Calikwaamba kuteeti mwami uyanda kuteeti bantu bamupe bulemu ooyu muntu munzila iindeene. Ape calikwaamba kuteeti ooyu muntu ulijesi nguzu zyokulela antoomwi omwami. Mulootu twaambo, Leza walikwaambila Mesiya kubweza cibbula eeci cobulemu okulela antoomwi anguwe. </char></note> lwangu lyobulemu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">kusika mane ndibike basinkondonyoko kunsi amaulaako.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yamana nkondo, wazunda walikutondezya nguzu zyakwe kuli sinkondonyina ngwaazunda kwiinda mukubika cituta cakwe munsingo yawooyo ngwaazunda kalede ansi muvu. </char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Nakuteeti Mwami Deveti we wakaita Mesiya kuteeti, ‘Mwami’ ino inga Mesiya waba buti wolunyungu lwakwe?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Jesu Wacenjezya Zyabamayi bo Mulawo</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateyo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Bantu banji balikubotelwa kumvwa Jesu kaiisya. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Naalikwiisya wakaamba kuteeti, “Amucenjele eziyanza zya bamayi bo Mulawo, bayandisya kuzyungaana kabazwete majansi malamfu okulumelesigwa elikute mumisika <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />okukala azibbula zibotu muzikombelo omumikiti. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Beenena bamukabafu okubanyanga lubono lwabo, ape bayanda kulibonesya kubantu kwiinda mukukomba kwabo kulamfu. Cisubulo cabo cinoindilide!”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupa Kwamuka Mufu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Kuzwaawo Jesu wakakala ambali ecibikilo camali mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza, kaebela bantu babika mali. Bunji bwabavubi bakabika mali manji. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Mpoonyina kwakeza mukamufu uupengede okubika tudibilisi tobile tomukuba. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Jesu wakaita basikwiiya bakwe antoomwi okubaambila kuteeti, “Nconzyo ndimwaambila kuteeti ooyu mukamufu, wabika kwiinda boonse, <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />kaambo bamwi babika tuniini kuzwa mubuvubi bwabo bunji. Kono we obupenzi bwakwe, wabika tudibilisi toonse twaajesi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Waamba Zyokukolomonwa kwe Ngʼanda ya Leza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mateyo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Jesu naalikuzwa mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza, umwi wabasikwiiya bakwe wakamwaambila kuteeti, “Omwiiyi! Bona mabwe kukomena amaanda ateni kubota!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Jesu wakataba kuteeti, “Ede mwaabona mayake mapati aaya? Taakwe bbwe naanga lyomwi litikasyaale polyeelede kuba, ayokolomonwa oonse.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapenzi a makatazyo aaza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mateyo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Jesu naalikukede acilundu ca Oliva, cilangeene Engʼanda ya Leza, Pita, Jemusi, Joni o Andulu bakamubuzisisya kumbali kuteeti, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Twaambile, ino eezi zizoocitika lili? Ape citondezyo nzi citakacitike kubonesya kuteeti nako yasika yokuteeti zyoonse eezi zicitike?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Jesu wakabaambila kuteeti, “Amucenjele, kuteeti kutabi muntu umweena, <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />kaambo mbanji batakaze muzina lyangu kabateeti, ‘Ndendime Mesiya’ okweena bantu banji. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Ape mutakakatazigwi mwaakumvwa nkondo empuwo zye nkondo. Eezi zintu zyeelede kuzocitika, kono tacaambi kuteeti mamanino asika. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Zisi ziyobukilana, bwami buyoolwana obwaminyina. Kuyooba kuzungaana kwenyika muzibaka zisiyene-siyene, ape kuyooba nzala. Aayo anooli ngematalikilo amapenzi, ayooba mbuli matalikilo aakumyongwa ko mwanakazi anolaafwi okutumbuka.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:17-20">Mateyo 10:17-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Luka 12:11-12</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Amucenjele! Muyaangwa okutolwa kunkuta okuumwa muzikombelo, kaambo kangu muyoima kunembo lyabeendelezi bamasena abami, kono ciyooba coolwe cokubaambila Makani Mabotu. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Cokusaanguna Makani Mabotu eelede kukambookwa kubantu boonse. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Mwaakwaangwa okutolwa kunkuta, mutakalibiliki azyemwandokataba kaitanasika nako. Yaakusika nako mukaambe kufumbwa majwi ngomuyoopegwa kaambo unooli Muuya Usalaala unaamboola kutaamba nywebo. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Mwananyina uyoaba mwananyina kuteeti ajaigwe ape abaisi bayocita mbweena namu kubana babo. Bana bayoobukila bazyali babo okubajazya. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mateyo 10:22</ref>.</char></note> Bantu boonse bayoomusula kaambo kangu. Kono kuteeti mwayuma kusikila kumamanino muyoofutulwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisesemyo ciyoosya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mateyo 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 9:27">Danyele 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Muyobona cisesemyo ciyoosya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mucigiliki, Cisesemyo caamba cintu citalikabotu, cinunka, mpoonyina ciyoosya caamba cipa kuteeti ngʼanda ya Leza isiigwe. Eeci citondezya buzangi, eco cisesemya kuli Leza abantu bakwe. Cibonesya mboba sofwaazya Ngʼanda ya Leza Bamasi banooeta mituni mu Ngʼanda ya Leza kupangisya kuteeti isiigwe, kaambo bantu ba Leza tabakonzya kunoonjila mu Ngʼanda ya Leza isofweede. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Aaya mabbala akabwezegwa mubbuku lya Daniyele 9:27; 11:31; 12:11. Jesu wakacenjezya kuteeti kulibonya “kwecisesemyo ciyoosya” calikwaamba kuteeti kumwaigwa Kwengʼanda ya Leza kwalaafwi akuti kucija kuzwa mu Jelusalemu amu Judiya kwali kupati. Majwi akabelesegwa muli Daniyele alikupandulula cintu cakeetwa mu Ngʼanda ya Leza abamasi. Cintu citondwa, cisesemyo ape cibi, cipa kuteeti Ngʼanda ya Leza isiigwe abantu ba Leza. </char></note> kaciimvwi mucibaka mociteelede kuba. Uubala amvwisisisye! Mpoonyina balimu Judiya bacijile mumalundu. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luka 17:31</ref>.</char></note> Ooyo uli aciluli cengʼanda atapilukili mungʼanda kuteegwa abweze zintu zyakwe. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Ooyo uli mumuunda atapilukili kuyoobweza jansi lyakwe kungʼanda. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Maawe kubanakazi bamisi abanyonsya mumazuba aayo! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Amukombe kuli Leza kuteeti ezi zitakacitikili mumpeyo, <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Danyele 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Ciyubunuzyo 7:14</ref>.</char></note> kaambo mapenzi amazuba aayo anoli mapati kwiinda oonse akacitika kuzwa nako Leza naakalenga nyika kusikila sunu. Ape taakwe nekuyooba zilinamu. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Mwami wakaacesya mazuba ateni. Kambe natakaacesya, taakwe walikunokonzya kufutuka, kono wakaacesya kaambo kabasale bakwe.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Muciindi eeco na umwi wakwaambila kuteeti, ‘Langa, Mesiya nguuno!’ Na ‘Langa, nguulya kuya!’ Utasyomi. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Ndaamba namu kaambo kuyoza bamamesiya abasinsimi babeji. Bayoocita zitondezyo zyamaleele ezikomosya kuteeti kwanokonzeka beene abantu mbakasala Leza. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Mucenjele! Ndamwaambilila cimo zintu zyoonse eezi kazitana citika.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuza ko Mwanoo Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mateyo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Izaya 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joeli 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Ciyubunuzyo 6:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Izaya 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Ezekelo 32:7</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Akwiinda mazuba amapenzi aaya, zuba liyoosiya, mweezi uyooleka kubala, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Izaya 34:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13">Ciyubunuzyo 6:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joeli 2:10</ref>.</char></note> nyenyeezi ziyooloka kuzwa kujulu enguzu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Caamba “inguzu” naanga “impi zyamyuuya” Iili mumulengalenga. Aaya majwi eenguluka kwaamba nyenyeezi aimwi mimuni iili mumulengalenga. Ape alakonzya kwaamba amyuuya mibi. Bantu banji balikuyeeya kuteeti myuuya mibi njiyali kweendelezya nyenyeezi. </char></note> zilimumulenga-lenga ziyoozungaanisigwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Danyele 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Ciyubunuzyo 1:7</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina aleeyo nako boonse bayoomubona Mwanoo Muntu keza mumayoba enguzu zipati obulemu. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Uzotuma bangelo kumabbazu enyika one kuteeti bakabunganye basale ba Leza kuzwa nyika yoonse.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ciiyo kuzwa kumukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mateyo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Amwiiye ciiyo kuzwa kumukuyu. Mitabi yateni yatalika kusyuuka okugwisya maani mapya, mulaziba kuteeti mainza alaafwiifwi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Munzila iswana eeci, mwazoobona zintu eezi kazicitika, muzoozibe kuteeti nako yaswena loko. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Nconzyo ndamwaambila kuteeti zyoonse eezi ziyoocitika bamwi bantu besunu kabatana kufwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Julu enyika ziyoomana kono majwi aangu taayoomani.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amulibambile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mateyo 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:36">Mateyo 24:36</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Taakwe uubuzi buzuba naanga nako Mwanoo Muntu nayoopiluka nebaba bangelo kujulu, naanga Mwana, aati Tata alike. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Mucenjele okulibambila, kaambo tamuzi nako niiyooza. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:36-38">Luka 12:36-38</ref>.</char></note> Buzuba oobo bunooli mbuli cikozyanyo comwaalumi wakalibambila kwiinka mumusinzo. Wakapa misebezi kubabelesi bakwe umwi oumwi okubasiila kuteeti beendelezye. Naakamana wakaambila mulangi kuteeti kalangilila, mpoonyina wakazwa angʼanda okwiinka mumusinzo. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Iino kamulibambilide, kaambo tamuzi na mukamwini ngʼanda uza lili. Inga kwaba kumazuba naanga akatikamasiku, na kubucedo naanga lyanooandula zuba. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Kuteeti weza pomutamuyeeyeli, teelede kumujana kamulede. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Eeci cendimwaambila, ndaambila boonse kuteeti: Kamulibambilide lyoonse!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Makanze Ookujaya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateyo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Joni 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kulonga 12:1-27</ref>.</char>
    </note> Iino kwasyeede feela mazuba obile kuteeti mukiti we Pasika Ecinkwa Citakwe Mumena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mabbala okuteeti Cinkwa Citakwe Mumena aamba mukiti ba Juda ngubali kusekelela mwaka omwaka kwa mazuba aali ciloba. Mumazuba aaya balikulya Cinkwa Citakwe Mumena. Nako Leza naakagwisya bamaisaabo kuzwa mu Ijipiti, bakazwa cokufwambaana fwambaana. Taakwe nibakajana nako yokupanga cinkwa cijesi mumena okulindila kuteeti cifutumuke. Muzeezo we Mukiti we Cinkwa Citakwe Mumena wali wokugwasya ba Juda kuyeeya eeci okulumba Leza caakabacitila. </char></note> ube. Bapaizi basilutwe abamayi bo Mulawo balikuyandoola nzila yokwaanga Jesu cokusisilikizya okumujaya. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Kono bakaamba kuteeti, “Tutaciti namu nako yomukiti, kaambo bantu inga batulwana.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Wananikwa ku Bbetaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mateyo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Joni 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Luka 7:37-38</ref>.</char>
    </note>Jesu wali mu Bbetaniya kungʼanda ya Saimoni mwaalumi walikunoonga waciswa cinsenda. Jesu naali kulya, kwakanjila mwanakazi walikujesi isanzi yakapangwa ebbwe lya alabbasita yalikuzwide mafuta aanunkilila aadula loko akapangidwe anadi yeni-yeni. Wakatyola nsingo yensazi okutila mafuta aaya amutwe wa Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Bamwi bantu baliko bakanyema mpoonyina bakaambilana kuteeti, “Ino usinyweeda nzi mafuta aaya? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Kambe auzigwa mali eensiliva ainda myaanda yotatwe kuteegwa kaapegwa bapenzi.” Mpoonyina bakamupatookela obi mwanakazi ooyu.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Kono Jesu wakateeti, “Amumuleke! Ino mumukatazizya nzi? Wandicitila cilikabotu. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Detilonomo 15:11</ref>.</char></note> Ede bapenzi banooli andinwe lyoonse cokuteeti kufumbwa pumwayandila inga mwabagwasya, kono tandinooli andinwe lyoonse. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Wacita caalikukonzya. Watila mafuta amubili wangu kuubambila kuzikwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Nconzyo ndamwaambila kuteeti, kufumbwa aaya Makani Mabotu kwayokambookwa nyika yoonse, eeci caacita ooyu mwanakazi aco cinoambwa mukuyeeya nguwe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judasi Wazumina Kwaaba Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mateyo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Mpoonyina Judasi Isikaliyoti, umwi wabasikwiiya bali kumi abobile, wakaya kubapaizi basilutwe kuteeti akamvwanaabo mbwatakaabe Jesu kulibo. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Bakabotelwa loko ezyakaamba, okumusyomezya kuteeti balamupa mali. Mpoonyina Judasi wakatalika kuyandoola nako mbotu cokwaaba Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu walya zilyo Zyepasika abasikwiiya bakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mateyo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka 22:7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Joni 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Mubuzuba bokusaanguna bo Mukiti we Cinkwa Citakwe Mumena, buzuba mbelele zyokulya a Pasika nizyalikujaigwa. Basikwiiya ba Jesu bakamubuzya kuteeti, “Ino kookuli koyanda kuteeti tukaakubambile zilyo zye Pasika?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakatuma bobile babo okubaambila kuteeti, “Kamuya mutaindi pati, muyooswaanwa omwaalumi uyumwine nongo mpati yamaanzi. Mumucilile <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />omo mungʼanda mwatikanjiile. Mpoonyina mukaambile beni ngʼanda kuteeti, ‘Mwiiyi wesu ubuzya kuteeti, Moomuli monditilide Pasika abasikwiiya bangu?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Mpoonyina ulamutondezya ngʼanda mpati iili mujulu, ibambidwe kale. Mukatubambile nkuko zyokulya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Basikwiiya bakanyamuka, okwiinka kutaindi pati. Bakakujana zyoonse zili mbuli mbwakaamba Jesu. Mpoonyina bakabamba zyokulya zye Pasika.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Kujolezya, Jesu wakasika abasikwiiya bakwe bali kumi abobile kuya kungʼanda. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Intembauzyo 41:9</ref>.</char></note> Nibali kulya atafule, wakateeti, “Nconzyo ndamwaambila kuteeti, omwi alindinywe ulandaaba, umwi uulimukulya andime.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Basikwiiya bakwe bakalimvwa oobi okutalika kumubuzya umwi oumwi kuteeti, “Ndime na?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Jesu wakateeti, “Umwi alindinywe nomulikumi abobile, uulimukusunsa andime cinkwa mumukeke omwi. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Mwanoo Muntu uyoofwa mbuli mbokulembedwe mumalembe, kono maawe kulooyo mwaalumi utakamwaabe. Nicakabota kambe naatakazyalwa feela!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulalilo wo Mwami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mateyo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Bakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Nibalikulya, Jesu wakabweza cinkwa okucikomoona, wakalumba Leza okupa basikwiiya bakwe okuteeti, “Amubweze, ooyu mubili wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Amane wakabweza nkomoki yawaini, wakalumba Leza okubatambika njiyo, mpoonyina boonse bakanywa mwateni. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kulonga 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jelemiya 31:31-34</ref>.</char></note> Jesu wakateeti, “Eeli ndigazi lyangu lyatililwa banji ape Leza ndyatabelesye kupanga cizuminano abantu. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Nconzyo ndimwaambila kuteeti siyounwi ape musinza womunsaansa, aati buzuba mbondiyonywa mupya mu Bwami bwa Leza.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Mpoonyina bakaimba lwiimbo okuya kucilundu ca Oliva.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu waamba kuteeti Pita uyoomukaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateyo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Joni 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zakalaya 13:7</ref>.</char>
    </note> Jesu wakabaambila kuteeti, “Noonse muyoocija okundisiya mbuli Leza mbwakaamba Mumalembo kuteeti, ‘Ndizojaya mweembezi mpoonyina mbelele zizoosabalanganizigwa.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mateyo 28:16</ref>.</char></note> Kono ndaakubusigwa, ndiyoomibeelela kwiinka ku Galileya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Pita wakataba kuteeti, “Mebo siyookusiyi naanga boonse bazookusiye!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Jesu wakaambila Pita kuteeti, “Ndikwaambila nconzyo, muzingili katana kukukuluka ziindi zyobile masiku eesunu, unooli wandikaka ziindi zyotatwe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Mane we naakazumanana kutaba cenguzu kateeti, “Siyoambi kwateni zilinamu, nakufwa inga ndafwa feela ayibo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Abasikwiiya bamwi boonse bakaamba mbwenya namu.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Wakomba mu Getisimani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mateyo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Kuzwaawo bakeza mumuunda we Getisimani, mpoonyina Jesu wakaambila basikwiiya bakwe kuteeti, “Amukale aawa nendicikomba.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Mpoonyina wakatolelezya Pita, Jemusi o Joni. Aleeyo nako wakatalika kulimvwa kupenga okuyoowa loko, <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />okubaambila kuteeti, “Aano ndiluuside loko kumoyo mane mbuli kuteeti ndandoofwa. Amusyaale aawa kamulanga.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Wakainka anembo aniini okulifusila aansi, mpoonyina wakakomba kuteeti na cilakonzyeka, ataindi mwateni muciindi camapenzi. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Wakakomba kuteeti, “Tata, Tata, zintu zyoonse zilakonzyeka kulindiwe. Igwisye eeyi nkomoki yamapenzi alindime. Kono luyando lwako alucitike, kutali luyando lwangu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Mpoonyina wakapiluka okujana aaba basikwiiya botatwe baloona. Wakabuzya Pita kuteeti, “Saimoni, uloona na? Wakacilwa kuteeti kolanga naanga kwewoola lyomwi feela na? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Kamulanga okupaila kuteegwa mutawidi mumasunko. Muuya ulayanda kono mubili uligonkedwe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Naakamana kwaamba namu wakapiluka kuyookomba ape, okuyoloolola majwi ngenya ngaalikwaambide. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Mpoonyina wakapiluka kuli basikwiiya bakwe okujana balimungʼonzi ape, tabacilikukonzya okulanga. Mpoonyina bakabula cokutamizya.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Mpoonyina wakainka kuyookomba katatu. Naakapiluka wakababuzya kuteeti, “Mucilede okupumuna na? Moona kwamana! Nako yasika! Amubone, Mwanoo Muntu wandooabwa mumaanza aaba sizibi. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Amunyamuke! Tutalikizye! Amubone! Ngooyu mwaalumi sikundaaba.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwaabwa Okwaangwa kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateyo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Joni 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Jesu naacili kwaamboola kwakasika Judasi, umwi wabasikwiiya bakwe bali kumi abobile. Wakeza edwi lyabantu balikuyumwide masabule amakoli. Bakatumwa abapaizi basilutwe, abamayi bo Mulawo, abamaalu. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Iino Judasi sikumwaaba wakapa bantu aaba citondezyo cokuteeti: “Mwaalumi ngonditimyonte ngonguwe ngomuyanda. Mumujate okumumamela mwanoyobumutola.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Naakasika feela Judasi, wakainka kuli Jesu okuteeti, “Omwiiyi!” Okumumyoonta. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Mpoonyina bakazoomujata Jesu okumwaanga. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Kono umwi wabasikwiiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Joni 18:10 yaamba kuteeti ooyu wali Pita. </char></note> bakwe wakaimvwi afwi wakagwisya sabule okutema kutimbula kutwi ko muzike wo Mupaizi mupati. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakateeti, “Ino muzidaanzi amasabule a makoli mbulikuteeti mwaza kuzojata cigebenga? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luka 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref>.</char></note> Buzuba obuzuba ndalaandinywe kandiisya mulabba lye Ngʼanda ya Leza, kono taakwe nimwakandaanga. Iino caba namu kuzuzikizya Malembo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Mpoonyina boonse basikwiiya bakwe bakacija okumusiya.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Umwi musyimani walikuyoobucilila Jesu kazweete feela mulebbo. Bakasola kumujata, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />kono wakabasupuka okubasiya omulebbo mumaanza okuzuza katazweete.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Watolwa ku Nkuta Mpati yaba Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mateyo 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Joni 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakatolwa ku ngʼanda yo Mupaizi Mupati, kwalikubungene Bapaizi basilutwe, bamaalu a bamayi bo Mulawo. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Pita walikuyoobucilila aleele mpoonyina wakanjila mulabba lye ngʼanda yo Mupaizi Mupati okukala abalindizi kabayota mulilo. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Bapaizi basilutwe abasololi Benkuta Mpati yaba Juda boonse bakasola kulangoola bumboni bokujailawo Jesu, kono taakwe mbubakajana. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Bakamboni banji bakamubejekezya kono zibalikwaamba tiizyalikweendelana.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Mpoonyina baalumi bamwi bakanyamuka okumutamizya kuteeti, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Joni 2:19</ref>.</char></note> “Twakamumvwa, kaamba kuteeti, ‘Eeyi Ngʼanda ya Leza yakapangwa abantu ndiyoimwacoola mpoonyina kwainda mazuba otatwe ndizoyaka imwi yatakapangwa abantu.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Abo aaba taakwe nibwakeendelana bumboni bwabo.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Mpoonyina Mupaizi Mupati wakaima kunembo lyabo boonse okubuzya Jesu kuteeti, “Totabi ali zyebalimukukutamikizya na?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Kono Jesu wakaumuna feela, taakwe zyakataba. Mpoonyina Mupaizi Mupati ape wakamubuzya kuteeti, “Ino ndiwe Mesiya Mwanaa Leza ulelekedwe na?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:62 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Danyele 7:13</ref>.</char>
    </note> Jesu wakataba kuteeti, “Ndendime. Noonse muzomubona Mwanoo Muntu kakede kululyo lwa Leza Singuzu ape kayoobuza amayoba okujulu!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jesu naalikwaamba eezi wakabweza majwi aakusinsimwa kwa Mesiya muli Daniyele 7:13-14. Mubusinsimi bokuteeti, umwi ulimbuli “Mwanoo Muntu” uleza enguzu zipati mumayoba kuzoolela mbuli mwami okuzoatula aabo bacita zibi. </char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Mpoonyina mupaizi Mupati wakayawoola zizwaato zyakwe okuteeti, “Tatuciyandi bambi bakamboni! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Levitiko 24:16</ref>.</char></note> Mwamumvwa mbwaasampoola Leza. Ino muyeeyawo buti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Boonse bakateeti, “Ajaigwe kaambo uloomulandu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Bamwi bakatalika kumuswida okumuvumba kumenso okumuuma kabateeti, “Sinsima, ngwani wakuuma?” Ape balindizi bakamubweza okumukambaika.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Mbwaakakaka Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mateyo 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Joni 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Iino Pita naacili kukede mulabba lye ngʼanda yo Mupaizi Mupati, umwi mwanakazi mubelesi wooyo Mupaizi wakeza. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Naakabona Pita kayota mulilo, wakamulangisisya okwaamba kuteeti, “Ayebo waloo Jesu, uulya mwaalumi woku Nazaleta.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Kono wakakaka okutaba kuteeti, “Tandimwizi ape tandizi ezyolimukwaamba.” Mpoonyina wakazwa okwiinka kumanjililo eelabba. Mpoonyina aawo muzingili wakakukuluka.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Mpoonyina ooyo mubelesi wakamubona ape, okunoindulula kwaambila bantu balikwiimvwi ambali kuteeti, “Ooyu nguumwi wabo.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Kono Pita wakakaka ape.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Nikwakainda kaindi, balikwiimvwi aambali bakamwaambila kuteeti, “Tokonzyi kukaka kuteeti uli umwi wabo kaambo ayebo uliwoku Galileya.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:70 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aaba bantu bakalizi kuteeti Jesu o Pita balikuzwa kucooko ce Galileya, kaambo bantu bo ku Galileya baliindene kukwaamboola abantu bo ku Jelusalemu (Mateyo 26:73). Jesu abasikwiiya bakwe boonse balikuzwa ku Galileya, kunze feela lya Judasi Isikaliyoti. </char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Mpoonyina Pita wakakonka kuteeti, “Leza andipe cisubulo na ndilabeja. Tandimwizi ooyo mwaalumi ngomwaamba.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Mpoonyinaawo muzingili wakakukuluka lwabili. Mpoonyina Pita wakayeeya zyakamwaambila Jesu kuteeti, “Muzingili kautana kukukuluka ziindi zyobile, uyoondikaka ziindi zyotatwe.” Mpoonyina wakagonkelwa okulila.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Weetwa kuli Pilato Muleli weci Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateyo 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Joni 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Bapaizi basilutwe abamaalu abamayi bo Mulawo abamwi boonse Benkuta Mpati yaba Juda bakamana kupangana. Mpoonyina Jesu bakamwaanga maceeni okumutola okumupa ku muleli Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato wakamubuzya kuteeti, “Ndendiwe mwami wama Juda na?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Jesu wakataba kuteeti, “Ndiwe waamba namu.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Mpoonyina Bapaizi Basilutwe bakatamikizya Jesu zintu zinji zibi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Kuzwaawo ape Pilato wakabuzya Jesu kuteeti, “Alizyoonse zibakutamikizya, totabi kwateni na?”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Kono Jesu wakaumuna feela, mpoonyina Pilato wakakomokwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu waatulwa kuteeti Ajaigwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateyo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Joni 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Iino nako ye Pasika Pilato wajesi citambo cokulukulula mwaange omwi ngubakumbila bantu. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Kwali mwaalumi walikwiitwa kuteeti Bbalabbasi walimuntolongo aleeyo nako abasikulipangula kaambo kamulandu wokujaya nako yamanyongwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Mpoonyina mbunga yabantu yakabungana okukumbila Pilato kuteeti abalukululwide sintolongo mbuli citambo cakwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Mpoonyina wakababuzya kuteeti, “Muyanda kuteegwa ndimwaangunwide ooyu Mwami wama Juda na?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Wakabuzya namu kaambo walizi kuteeti bapaizi basilutwe bakaaba Jesu mumaanzaakwe kaambo komunyono.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Kono bapaizi basilutwe bakayunga bantu kuteeti basale kuteegwa kulukululwe Bbalabbasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Mpoonyina Pilato wakababuzya ape kuteeti, “Ino ooyo ngomuteeti mwami wama Juda ndimucite buti?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Bakoongolola kuteeti, “Akankaminwe aciingano!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Imwi nzila yaba Loma yokusubula cigebenga yali yokucikankamina. Bali kwiinganya zisamu zyobile zipati okuziswaanganya antoomwi. Mpoonyina basilumamba balikukankamina naanga kwaangilila maanza ecigebenga kucisamu comwi amaulu kulicimwi cisamu. Balikwiimikizya ciingano kulanga mujulu okucileka cigebenga kuteeti cifwe lufu lucisa mbicaani-mbicaani alincico. </char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Kono Pilato wakabuzya kuteeti, “Ino wacita mulandu nzi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Mpoonyina nibakoongololesya kuteeti, “Aakankaminwe!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Mukuyanda kubotezya bantu, Pilato wakabalukulwida Bbalabbasi okukwabboozya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kweendelanya ecizo caba Loma, mwaange wali kusyapwa endufwa yakapangidwe otutambotambo twecikutu twakabikidwe kucijatizyo cecisamu. Kanjikanji tutambo twakajesi otubulobulo naanga tufuwafuwa twakabikidwe kwateni kuteegwa kacicisa loko. </char></note> Jesu, okumupa kuli basilumamba kuteeti bamukankamine.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basilumamba mbubakafubazika Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mateyo 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Joni 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Mpoonyina basilumamba bakanjizya Jesu mulabba lyengʼanda yomweendelezi okwiita basilumamba bamwi boonse balikubede kwateni. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Kuzwaawo bakazwaatika Jesu jansi lyomusyobo wecisombo, bakapanga musyini wamaumvwa okumuzwaatika nguwo kumutwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Mpoonyina bakatalika kumutondezya likute lyokumufubazya, kabateeti, “Wabonwa o mwami wama Juda!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Mpoonyina balikwiiindulula kumuuma kumutwe akabalelo okumuswida, okumufugamina kutondezya likute lyokumufubazya. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Nibakamana kumufubazika bakamutubula jansi okumuzwatika zizwaato zyakwe, mpoonyina bakamutola kuyoomukankamina.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakankaminwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateyo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Joni 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:13">Banaloma 16:13</ref>.</char>
    </note> Umwi mwaalumi walikwiitwa kuteeti Saimoni woku Sailini, nguwali isi wa Alekizanda o Lufasi walikuzwa kumiinzi kayoobuya mutaindi, mpoonyina basilumamba bakamuswaana munzila okumusungilizya kunyamuna ciingano. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Mpoonyina bakatola Jesu kucibaka ciitwa kuteeti Gologota, kokuteeti, “Cibaka ca kapapa komutwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kapapa komutwe Ibbala lye kapapa kokumutwe lyaamba cintu comwi efuwa lyo kumutwe. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Bakasola kumupa waini ivweene omusamu wiitwa kuteeti mili kono taakwe nakainywa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Intembauzyo 22:18</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina bakamukankamina aciingano okwaabana zizwato zyakwe mulicabo. Bakauma cisolo kuteeti bazibe mbobataabane zizwato muntu o muntu. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Bakakankamina Jesu mujunzoonza awoola lye fuka. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Cikwankwani calembedwe cibakamujaila kuteeti, “Mwami wama Juda.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Ape kwali ezigebenga zyobile zyakakankaminwa o Jesu, comwi kululyo lwakwe cimbi kucigoyo cakwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />(Munzila eeyi Malembo akazuzikizigwa aamba kuteeti, “Wakabalilizigwa ezigebenga.”) <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Izaya 53:12</ref>.</char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ambi malembo otumpango tumwi alakavwanya kapango ka 15:28 Munzila njonyeeyi Malembo akazuzikizigwa aamba kuteeti, “Wakabalilizigwa ezigebenga.” </char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:7">Intembauzyo 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Maako 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Joni 2:19</ref>.</char>
    </note> Bantu bali kwiindooka bali kuzungaanya mitwe okufubaazika Jesu kuteeti, “Ehee! Walikwaamba kuteeti Ngʼanda ya Leza ulaimwacoola okwiiyakulula mumazuba otatwe! <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Lifutule, kozwa aciingano!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Mbweenya namu Bapaizi Basilutwe abamayi bo Mulawo bakafubaazika Jesu kabaamboola mulicabo kuteeti, “Wakafutula bamwi kono wakacilwa kulifutula! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Aseluke aciingano ooyu Mesiya Mwami wa Izilayeli tubone, netutimusyome.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Aabo bobile bakakankaminwa limwi o Jesu bakamufubaazika.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufwa kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateyo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Joni 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Musikati nilyali akati zuba kwakaba mudima nyika yoonse kwamawoola otatwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Intembauzyo 22:1</ref>.</char></note> Muwoola lyatatu kujolezya, Jesu wakoongolola kuteeti, <char style="tl">“Eloyi, eloyi, lema sabbakatani?” </char> Kokuteeti, “O Leza wangu, O Leza wangu, wandisiila nzi?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Bamwi bantu baliwo taakwe nibakamvwisisisya, bakaamba kuteeti, “Amumvwe! Ulimukwiita Elija<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muci Hibbulu, ibbala lya “Leza” lilikozyenye ezina lya “Elija”. Bantu tebakamvwisisizye zyaakali kwaamba Jesu mukampango ka 34.</char></note> Musinsimi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Intembauzyo 69:21</ref>.</char></note> Umwi wabo wakazuza okuyoonika ciponci mu waini ipapa, okucibika kumpela yebbalo. Kuzwaawo wakacinyamuna okucibika kumulomo wa Jesu mpoonyina wakateeti, “Atulindile tubone na Elija uleza kuzomugwisya aciingano!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Mpoonyina Jesu wakoongolola okuyeeka kamamanino.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Kulonga 26:31-33</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mpoonyinaawo sila lyomu Ngʼanda ya Leza lyakayauka akati muzipaanzi zyobile kuzwa ajulu kusikilaansi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Mupati wabasilumamba walikweendelezya kujaigwa kwa Jesu wakaimvwi kunembo kweciingano, naakabona mbwaakafwa Jesu wakaamba kuteeti, “Nconzyo ooyu mwaalumi wali Mwanaa Leza!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Luka 8:2-3</ref>.</char>
    </note> Kwali abanakazi bamwi balikulangila aleele, akati kabo kwali Maliya Magadalena o Maliya banyina Jemusi muniini o Josefa o Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Jesu naali mu Galileya aaba banakazi balikumucilila okumugwasya. Kwakali abamwi banakazi banji kwateni bakeza anguwe ku Jelusalemu.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzikwa kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateyo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joni 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42-43" />Yali nako yokumazuba Josefa woku Alamatiya naakasika. Josefa wali umwi walikukutekwa waabo Benkuta Mpati ya Majuda walikulindila kuza ko Bwami bwa Leza. Bwali buzuba Bokulibambila,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:42-43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Buzuba Bokulibambila ndezina lyeci Juda lyo buzuba bwalikucilila Nsabata. Bwali kwiitwa kuteeti mbuzuba Bokulibambila kaambo bantu balikweelede kulibambila Nsabata. Nsabata bwali buzuba bwatali kuzumizigwa kubeleka. Buzuba Bokulibambila bwali kutalika muli Bwane kumazuba mane kuyoosika muli Bwasanu kumazuba. </char></note> obu bwali Buzuba bwalikucilila Nsabata, Josefa wakaliyumya okwiinka kuli Pilato kuyookumbila mutunta wa Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:42-43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato wakakomokwa kumvwa kuteeti Jesu walifwide kale. Mpoonyina wakaita mupati wabasikalumamba okumubuzya kuteeti, “Nconzyo Jesu wafwakale na?” <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Mupati wabasikalumamba wakazumina kuteeti nconzyo wafwa. Mpoonyina Pilato wakazumizya Josefa kuubweza mutunta. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Kuzwaawo Josefa wakaula sila liteteete, waka selusya mutunta okuuvungaila mwateni okuubika mumpangala yakasigwa mubbwe pati loko. Mpoonyina wakakunkulisizya fateni bbwe pati kuvumba mulyango we cuumbwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Maliya Magadalena o Maliya banyina Josefa balikulangilila okubona mutunta wa Jesu puwakabikwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kubuka kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mateyo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Joni 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Niyakainda Nsabata Maliya Magadalena o Salome o Maliya banyina Jemusi bakaula mafuta anunkilila kuteeti bakananike mubili wa Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Mujunzoonza loko lye Nsunda, nilyakaandula zuba <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muci Giliki: Mbuzuba bokusaanguna munsunda.</char></note> bakanyamuka kuya kucuumbwe. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3-4" />Kabacili munzila balikuyoobubuzyana kuteeti, “Ngwani utikatukunkulisizye bbwe kuzwa amulyango wecuumbwe?” Balikubuzyanya namu kaambo bbwe lyali pati loko. Mpoonyina bakalanga okubona kuteeti lyalikunkulisidwe kale. <verse eid="MRK 16:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Bakanjila mucuumbwe okujana musyimani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muli Mateyo 28:2 omuli Luuka 24:4 lipandulula kuteeti ooyu muntu wali mungelo wakatumwa o Leza. Ooyu mungelo walikulibonya mbuli musyimani, Maako caakamupandulula namu. </char></note> walikukede kululyo, wazweete jansi lituba buu! Mpoonyina bakayoowa okukomokwa loko.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />We wakateeti, “Mutayoowi! Ndilizi mulangoola Jesu woku Nazaleta wakakankaminwa. Tawo kuno, wabusigwa. Amubone, aawa pubali kumubikide. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mateyo 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Maako 14:28</ref>.</char></note> Iino kamuya mukaambile Pita abasikwiiya bamwi kuteeti, ulikunembo lyenu uyoobuya ku Galileya, komutikamubonene mboonyina mbuli mbwakamwaambila.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Bakazwa kucuumbwe kabayoobuzuza oku kabatuntuma okuyoowa. Kaambo kobuyoofu taakwe ngubakaambila zili zyoonse.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tulizi kuzwa kuli Mateyo 28:9-10 kuteeti Jesu wakadunukila banakazi aaba mukaindi kaniini. Mweendi wakacita namu kuteegwa batayoowi kwaambila basikwiiya mulumbe wo mungelo. Tulizi ape kuzwa muli Luka 24:9-11 kuteeti banakazi bakaambila basikwiiya ba Jesu mulumbe womungelo nibakazwa kucuumbwe, kono taakwe nibakabasyoma.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mamanino amwi a Maako</para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wadunukila Maliya Magadalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mateyo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Joni 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Mujunzoonza mu Nsondo naakabusigwa kuzwa kubafu Jesu wakasaanguna kudunukila Maliya Magadalena, ngwalinoonga watanda madimona aali ciloba mulinguwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nikuba kuteeti malembo eciindi loko obile muci Giliki taajesi tumpango 9-20, malembo manji asyomwa alitujesi kale. Bunji bwaba sicikolo ce Bbaibbele bayeeya kuteeti tumpango ootu twakalembwa aumwi kutali Maako, kono tucibalwa kuteeti tulaabumboni bupati kuli zyakacitika kuzwa Jesu naakabuka kuzwa kubafu. Kulikukozyanya muli Maako 16:9-20 amuli Mateyo 28:9-10, 16-20, Luka 24:13-49, Joni 20:10-23, amu Misebezi ya Baapositola 1:6-8.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Maliya Magadalena wakainka kuyaambila beenzinyina ba Jesu balikuuside kabalila. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Kono nibakamumvwa kaamba kuteeti wamubona Jesu muumi, taakwe nibakamusyoma.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wadunukila basikwiiya bobile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Kuzwaawo Jesu wakadunukila basikwiiya bobile kabayoobuzwa mutaindi kuya mumiinzi, kono walikulibonya bumbi cokuteeti taakwe nibakamuziba. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Bakapiluka okuyoambila bamwi kono taakwe wakabasyoma.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Wadunukila Bali Kumi Awomwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateyo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Joni 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Misebezi 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Kumamanino Jesu wakadunukila basikwiiya bali kumi awomwi kabalya. Wakabapatookela kaambo kokubula lusyomo okuyuma mitwe kaambo taakwe nibakabasyoma aabo bakamubona kabukide kuzwa kubafu. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Misebezi 1:8</ref>.</char></note> Mpoonyina wakabaambila kuteeti, “Kamuya mukakambooke makani mubotu kubantu boonse, nyika yoonse. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Kufumbwa utaakasyome okubbabbatizigwa uyofutulwa, ape kufumbwa uutakasyomi uyoopegwa mulandu. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Basyomi bayoopegwa nguzu zyokucita maleele, bayotanda madimona muzina lyangu, bayoamboola misyobo njebatazi, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />bayoobweza nzoka okunywa zijaya kono taziyobajayi, bayoobika maanza aabo abaciswa mpoonyina bayoopona.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwami Jesu watolwa kujulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Misebezi 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Misebezi 1:9-11</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mwami Jesu naakamanisya kwaamboola abo, wakatolwa kujulu okuyookala kubbazu lyobulemu lyolulyo lwa Leza. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Mpoonyina basikwiiya bakainka okuyookambooka koonse-koonse, ape Mwami wakabeleka abo okutondezya kuteeti zibalikukambooka zyanconzyo kwiinda mumaleele alikucitika.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mamanino amwi eciindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Banakazi bakainka kuyoopandulwida Pita abenzinyina mubufwiifwi zyoonse zibakaambilwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Kuzwaawo kwiinda muli basikwiiya, Jesu wakatuma mulumbe uusalala wolufutuko uutamani nyika yoonse.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amwi malembo obusanduluzi bweciindi bulijesi aaya mamanino mafwiifwi kukumana kwa makani kuyungizizya kukumana kwa malamfu (9-20). </char></note><verse eid="MRK 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>